BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Tatkhalsa Foundation//Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri (Sambat 2082–2086)
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Asia/Kolkata
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:daily-2025-03-14@calendar.tatkhalsa.in
DTSTAMP:20260314T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250314
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250315
SUMMARY:1 Chet 2082 · Phagun Puranmashi (੧ ਚੇਤ ੨੦੮੨) — Chet Sangrand · Chet Sangrand 2082 · Akali Baba Phula Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 1 Chet\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੧ ਚੇਤ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Phagun Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਫੱਗਣ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:26 PM\, 14 Mar\nSangrand: 1 Chet (ਚੇਤ ਸੰਗਰਾਂਦ) · Sankranti at 12:24 PM\, 14 Mar IST\n\nChet Sangrand — Bikrami New Year (Sambat 2082) & Shaheedi Akali Baba Phula Singh Ji / ਚੇਤ ਸੰਗਰਾਂਦ — ਬਿਕ੍ਰਮੀ ਨਵਾਂ ਸਾਲ (ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨) ਅਤੇ ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਅਕਾਲੀ ਬਾਬਾ ਫੂਲਾ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\n1 Chet\, Sambat 2082 (Meena Sankranti) · Opening of Bikrami Sambat 2082 with Barah Maha Majh ("Chet Govind Aradhiye") and Shaheedi remembrance of Jathedar Akali Baba Phula Singh Ji (Battle of Naushehra\, 1823).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Barah Maha Majh) (Ang 133 · Chet Govind Aradhiye) | Prachin Panth Prakash (Bhai Rattan Singh Bhangu) (Akal Takhat & Budha Dal Chronicle · 1 Chet 1880 Bikrami)\n\nShaheedi Divas — Jathedar Akali Baba Phula Singh Ji (Battle of Naushehra) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਜਥੇਦਾਰ ਅਕਾਲੀ ਬਾਬਾ ਫੂਲਾ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਜੰਗ ਨੌਸ਼ਹਿਰਾ)\n1 Chet\, Sambat 2082 (1 Chet\, Sambat 1879) · Martyrdom of Jathedar of Sri Akal Takht Sahib and Budha Dal\, Akali Baba Phula Singh Ji Nihung\, leading the victorious Khalsa charge at the Battle of Naushehra (1823 CE).\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Panth Prakash (Giani Gian Singh) (Entry: Phula Singh Akali · Battle of Naushehra\, 1 Chet 1879)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,Sangrand\,Puranmashi\,KHALSA\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:daily-2025-03-15@calendar.tatkhalsa.in
DTSTAMP:20260314T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250315
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250316
SUMMARY:2 Chet 2082 · Chet Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੨ ਚੇਤ ੨੦੮੨) — Holla Mohalla
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 2 Chet\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੨ ਚੇਤ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Chet Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਚੇਤ ਵਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 02:35 PM\, 15 Mar\n\nHolla Mohalla (Sri Anandpur Sahib) / ਹੋਲਾ ਮਹੱਲਾ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਨੰਦਪੁਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\nChet Vadhi 1 (2 Chet\, Sambat 2082) · Khalsa martial gathering instituted by Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji at Qila Holgarh\, Sri Anandpur Sahib on Chet Vadhi 1.\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Rut 4\, Ansu 20–24 · Holgarh Fort\, Sri Anandpur Sahib)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
