DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 30 Chet\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੩੦ ਚੇਤ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Chet Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਚੇਤ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 05:54 AM\, 13 Apr\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Pipa Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਪੀਪਾ ਜੀ\nChet Puranmashi (30 Chet\, Sambat 2082) · Commemoration of Bhagat Pipa Ji\, author of the Dhanasri shabad on Ang 695 of Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji ("Jo Brahmande Soi Pinde").\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Raag Dhanasri — Bhagat Pipa Ji) (Ang 695 · Jo Brahmande Soi Pinde)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
