DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 8 Vaisakh\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੮ ਵੈਸਾਖ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Vaisakh Vadhi 8 (Ashtami) · ਵੈਸਾਖ ਵਦੀ ੮ (ਅਸ਼ਟਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 07:01 PM\, 21 Apr\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Dhanna Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਧੰਨਾ ਜੀ\n8 Vaisakh\, Sambat 2082 (Dhuan Kalan\, Tonk) · Birth commemoration of Shiromani Bhagat Dhanna Ji (1415 CE)\, whose three Asa and Dhanasri shabads are enshrined in Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Raag Dhanasri — Bhagat Dhanna Ji) (Ang 695 · Gopal Tera Aarta)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
