SUMMARY:17 Vaisakh 2082 · Vaisakh Sudhi 3 (Teej (Tritiya)) (੧੭ ਵੈਸਾਖ ੨੦੮੨) — Sardar Hari Singh Nalwa
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 17 Vaisakh\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੧੭ ਵੈਸਾਖ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Vaisakh Sudhi 3 (Teej (Tritiya)) · ਵੈਸਾਖ ਸੁਦੀ ੩ (ਤੀਜ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 02:14 PM\, 30 Apr\n\nShaheedi Divas — Sardar Hari Singh Nalwa (Battle of Jamrud) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਸਰਦਾਰ ਹਰੀ ਸਿੰਘ ਨਲੂਆ (ਜਮਰੌਦ ਦੀ ਜੰਗ)\n17 Vaisakh\, Sambat 2082 (Jamrud Fort\, 1837) · Martyrdom of Khalsa Commander-in-Chief Sardar Hari Singh Nalwa defending Jamrud Fort at the Khyber Pass on 30 April 1837.\nSources: Prachin Panth Prakash & Khalsa Raj Chronicles (Battle of Jamrud · 1894 Bikrami (30 April 1837))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
