SUMMARY:21 Vaisakh 2082 · Vaisakh Sudhi 7 (Saptami) (੨੧ ਵੈਸਾਖ ੨੦੮੨) — Mai Bhago Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 21 Vaisakh\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੨੧ ਵੈਸਾਖ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Vaisakh Sudhi 7 (Saptami) · ਵੈਸਾਖ ਸੁਦੀ ੭ (ਸਪਤਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 07:21 AM\, 4 May\n\nRemembrance — Mata Bhag Kaur Ji (Mai Bhago Ji) / ਯਾਦਗਾਰ — ਮਾਤਾ ਭਾਗ ਕੌਰ ਜੀ (ਮਾਈ ਭਾਗੋ ਜੀ)\n21 Vaisakh\, Sambat 2082 (Sri Muktsar Sahib & Jinvara) · Commemoration of Mata Bhag Kaur Ji (Mai Bhago Ji)\, who rallied the Forty Mukte at Khidrane di Dhab and served in the retinue of Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji.\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Ayan 1\, Ansu 44–49 · Mai Bhago Ji & Battle of Khidrana)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
