SUMMARY:16 Jeth 2082 · Jeth Sudhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) (੧੬ ਜੇਠ ੨੦੮੨) — Shaheedi Guru Arjan Dev Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 16 Jeth\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੧੬ ਜੇਠ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Jeth Sudhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) · ਜੇਠ ਸੁਦੀ ੪ (ਚੌਥ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:25 PM\, 30 May\n\nShaheedi Divas — Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji (Shaheedan De Sartaj) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਅਰਜਨ ਦੇਵ ਜੀ (ਸ਼ਹੀਦਾਂ ਦੇ ਸਰਤਾਜ)\nJeth Sudhi 4 (16 Jeth\, Sambat 2082) · Puratan lunar martyrdom commemoration of Fifth Patshah Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji at Lahore (Jeth Sudhi 4\, Sambat 1663 Bikrami / 1606 CE).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Raag Asa — Mahalla 5) (Ang 394 · Tera Kiya Meetha Lage) | Bhatt Vahi Multani Sindhi (Jeth Sudhi 4\, Sambat 1663 Bikrami · Lahore Shaheedi)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
