SUMMARY:11 Harh 2082 · Harh Masya (੧੧ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ੨੦੮੨) — Baba Banda Singh Bahadur
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 11 Harh\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੧੧ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Harh Vadhi 15 (Masya) · ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ਵਦੀ ੧੫ (ਮੱਸਿਆ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 04:03 PM\, 25 Jun\n\nShaheedi Divas — Baba Banda Singh Bahadur & 740 Khalsa Shaheeds / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਬਾਬਾ ਬੰਦਾ ਸਿੰਘ ਬਹਾਦਰ ਅਤੇ ੭੪੦ ਖ਼ਾਲਸਾ ਸ਼ਹੀਦ\n11 Harh\, Sambat 2082 (Mehrauli\, Delhi · 1716) · Martyrdom of Baba Banda Singh Bahadur\, his four-year-old son Baba Ajai Singh Ji\, and 740 steadfast Khalsa Singhs at Delhi (Harh 1773 Bikrami / June 1716).\nSources: Prachin Panth Prakash (Bhai Rattan Singh Bhangu) (Sirhind Fateh & Delhi Shaheedi Chronicle · 1773 Bikrami)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,Masya\,SHAHEEDI
