SUMMARY:15 Harh 2082 · Harh Sudhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) (੧੫ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ੨੦੮੨) — Maharaja Ranjit Singh Barsi
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 15 Harh\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੧੫ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Harh Sudhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) · ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ਸੁਦੀ ੪ (ਚੌਥ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:16 AM\, 29 Jun\n\nBarsi — Sher-e-Punjab Maharaja Ranjit Singh Ji / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸ਼ੇਰ-ਏ-ਪੰਜਾਬ ਮਹਾਰਾਜਾ ਰਣਜੀਤ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\n15 Harh\, Sambat 2082 (Lahore\, 1896 Bikrami) · Annual remembrance of Sher-e-Punjab Maharaja Ranjit Singh Ji (1780–1839)\, founder of the sovereign Khalsa Empire (Sarkar-e-Khalsa).\nSources: Umdat-ut-Tawarikh & Khalsa Darbar Records (15 Harh 1896 Bikrami (27 June 1839) · Lahore)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,BARSI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
