SUMMARY:25 Harh 2082 · Harh Sudhi 14 (Chaudas (Chaturdashi)) (੨੫ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ੨੦੮੨) — Shaheedi Bhai Mani Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 25 Harh\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੨੫ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Harh Sudhi 14 (Chaudas (Chaturdashi)) · ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੪ (ਚੌਦਸ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 01:38 AM\, 10 Jul\n\nShaheedi Divas — Shaheed Bhai Mani Singh Ji (Band-Band Katwana) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਸ਼ਹੀਦ ਭਾਈ ਮਨੀ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਬੰਦ-ਬੰਦ ਕਟਵਾਉਣਾ)\n25 Harh\, Sambat 2082 (Nakhas Chowk\, Lahore · 1737) · Martyrdom of Head Granthi of Sri Harmandir Sahib and Damdami Bir scribe Bhai Mani Singh Ji\, dismembered joint by joint at Lahore.\nSources: Prachin Panth Prakash (Bhai Rattan Singh Bhangu) (Shaheedi Prasang of Bhai Mani Singh Ji · Lahore)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
