SUMMARY:1 Sawan 2082 · Sawan Vadhi 6 (Chhat (Shashthi)) (੧ ਸਾਵਣ ੨੦੮੨) — Sawan Sangrand · Shaheedi Bhai Taru Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 1 Sawan\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੧ ਸਾਵਣ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Sawan Vadhi 6 (Chhat (Shashthi)) · ਸਾਵਣ ਵਦੀ ੬ (ਛਠ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:04 PM\, 16 Jul\nSangrand: 1 Sawan (ਸਾਵਣ ਸੰਗਰਾਂਦ) · Sankranti at 10:51 AM\, 16 Jul IST\n\nShaheedi Divas — Shaheed Bhai Taru Singh Ji (Khopri Lahauna) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਸ਼ਹੀਦ ਭਾਈ ਤਾਰੂ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਖੋਪਰੀ ਲੁਹਾਉਣਾ)\n1 Sawan\, Sambat 2082 (Sawan Sangrand · 1745) · Martyrdom of Bhai Taru Singh Ji of Poola village\, who gave his scalp at Lahore to preserve his unshorn Kes on 1 Sawan 1802 Bikrami.\nSources: Prachin Panth Prakash (Bhai Rattan Singh Bhangu) (Shaheedi of Bhai Taru Singh Ji · 1 Sawan 1802 Bikrami)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,Sangrand\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
