SUMMARY:26 Sawan 2082 · Bhadon Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੨੬ ਸਾਵਣ ੨੦੮੨) — Adi Bir & 11 Bhatts
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 26 Sawan\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੨੬ ਸਾਵਣ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਵਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:11 PM\, 10 Aug\n\nAdi Bir Completion Colophon (Kartarpur Bir) & All 11 Bhatt Sahibaan / ਆਦਿ ਬੀੜ ਸੰਪੂਰਨਤਾ ਹਵਾਲਾ (ਕਰਤਾਰਪੁਰੀ ਬੀੜ) ਅਤੇ ੧੧ ਭੱਟ ਸਾਹਿਬਾਨ\nBhadon Vadhi 1 (26 Sawan\, Sambat 2082) · Manuscript completion date of the Kartarpur Adi Bir by Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji and Bhai Gurdas Ji (Bhadon Vadhi 1\, 1661 Bikrami) and remembrance of all 11 Bhatt Sahibaan.\nSources: Kartarpur Adi Bir Manuscript Colophon (Sambat 1661 Miti Bhadon Vadi 1 Pothi Likhi Pahunche) | Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Swaiye Mahalle Pehle Ke) (Ang 1389 · Bhatt Kalh Ji & 11 Bhatt Sahibaan)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
