SUMMARY:8 Bhadon 2082 · Bhadon Sudhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੮ ਭਾਦੋਂ ੨੦੮੨) — Pehla Parkash SGGS Ji · 6 Bhagat Sahibaan (SGGS) · Bhai Satta & Balwand Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 8 Bhadon\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੮ ਭਾਦੋਂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Sudhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਸੁਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 11:50 AM\, 24 Aug\n\nPehla Parkash Purab — Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Sri Harmandir Sahib\, 1604) / ਪਹਿਲਾ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਹਰਿਮੰਦਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ\, ੧੬੦੪)\nBhadon Sudhi 1 (8 Bhadon\, Sambat 2082) · 421st anniversary of the First Installation of Adi Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji at Sachkhand Sri Harmandir Sahib with Baba Budha Ji as First Granthi\, plus Bhagat & Satta-Balwand Bani.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (First Hukamnama — Raag Suhi Mahalla 5) (Ang 783 · Santa Ke Karaj Aap Khaloya)\n\nBhagat Bani Commemoration — Bhagat Trilochan\, Beni\, Bhikhan\, Sadhna\, Parmanand & Surdas Ji / ਭਗਤ ਬਾਣੀ ਯਾਦਗਾਰ — ਭਗਤ ਤ੍ਰਿਲੋਚਨ\, ਬੇਣੀ\, ਭੀਖਨ\, ਸਧਨਾ\, ਪਰਮਾਨੰਦ ਅਤੇ ਸੂਰਦਾਸ ਜੀ\n8 Bhadon\, Sambat 2082 (Pehla Parkash SGGS · Mahan Kosh Note) · Commemorating the six SGGS Bhagat Sahibaan whose exact birth days are unrecorded in Puratan chronicles: Bhagat Trilochan Ji (Ang 92\, 525\, 695)\, Bhagat Beni Ji (Ang 93\, 489\, 1351)\, Bhagat Bhikhan Ji (Ang 659)\, Bhagat Sadhna Ji (Ang 858)\, Bhagat Parmanand Ji (Ang 1253)\, and Bhagat Surdas Ji (Ang 1253).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 92\, 93\, 489\, 525\, 659\, 695\, 858\, 1253\, 1351 · Bhagat Bani) | Mahan Kosh (Bhai Kahn Singh Nabha) (Entries: Trilochan\, Beni\, Bhikhan\, Sadhna\, Parmanand\, Surdas)\n\nGursikh Bani-kars — Bhai Satta Ji & Bhai Balwand Ji (Ramkali Ki Vaar\, SGGS Ang 966) / ਗੁਰਸਿੱਖ ਬਾਣੀਕਾਰ — ਭਾਈ ਸੱਤਾ ਜੀ ਅਤੇ ਭਾਈ ਬਲਵੰਡ ਜੀ (ਰਾਮਕਲੀ ਕੀ ਵਾਰ\, ਅੰਗ ੯੬੬)\n8 Bhadon\, Sambat 2082 (Pehla Parkash SGGS · Mahan Kosh Note) · Honoring court Rababis and SGGS Gursikh Bani-kars Bhai Satta Ji & Bhai Balwand Ji\, authors of Ramkali Ki Vaar (Tikke Di Vaar\, Ang 966–968) praising the Guru Gaddi succession.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 966–968 · Ramkali Ki Vaar (Rai Balwand & Satta Doom))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,GURPURAB\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
