SUMMARY:12 Bhadon 2082 · Bhadon Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) (੧੨ ਭਾਦੋਂ ੨੦੮੨) — Bhai Gurdas Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 12 Bhadon\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੧੨ ਭਾਦੋਂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਸੁਦੀ ੫ (ਪੰਚਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 05:58 PM\, 28 Aug\n\nJoti Jot — Bhai Gurdas Ji (Scribe of Adi Granth Sahib Ji) / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ — ਭਾਈ ਗੁਰਦਾਸ ਜੀ (ਆਦਿ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੀ ਦੇ ਲਿਖਾਰੀ)\nBhadon Sudhi 5 (12 Bhadon\, Sambat 2082) · Annual commemoration of Bhai Gurdas Ji (1551–1636)\, scribe of Adi Granth Sahib Ji and author of the 40 Vaaran ("Gurbani di Kunji").\nSources: Bhai Gurdas Ji Vaaran (Vaar 1\, Pauri 27 · Satgur Nanak Pragatia)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,BARSI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
