SUMMARY:15 Bhadon 2082 · Bhadon Sudhi 8 (Ashtami) (੧੫ ਭਾਦੋਂ ੨੦੮੨) — Chaupai Sahib Colophon
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 15 Bhadon\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੧੫ ਭਾਦੋਂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Sudhi 8 (Ashtami) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਸੁਦੀ ੮ (ਅਸ਼ਟਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:59 AM\, 1 Sept\n\nSri Dasam Granth Colophon — Completion of Benti Chaupai Sahib (1753 Bikrami) / ਸ੍ਰੀ ਦਸਮ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਹਵਾਲਾ — ਬੇਨਤੀ ਚੌਪਈ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਸੰਪੂਰਨਤਾ (੧੭੫੩ ਬਿਕ੍ਰਮੀ)\nBhadon Sudhi 8 (15 Bhadon\, Sambat 2082) · Scriptural colophon date of Charitropakhyan & Benti Chaupai Sahib revealed by Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji on the banks of the Satluj (Bhadon Sudhi Ashtami\, 1753 Bikrami).\nSources: Sri Dasam Granth Sahib Ji (Charitropakhyan 405 · Benti Chaupai) (Ang 1388 · Bhadrav Sudhi Ashtami Ravi Vaara\, Teer Satudrav Granth Sudhaara)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
