DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250916
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250917
SUMMARY:31 Bhadon 2082 · Assu Vadhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) (੩੧ ਭਾਦੋਂ ੨੦੮੨) — Joti Jot Guru Nanak Ji · Guru Nanak Dev Ji Parivar
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 31 Bhadon\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੩੧ ਭਾਦੋਂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Assu Vadhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) · ਅੱਸੂ ਵਦੀ ੧੦ (ਦਸਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:23 AM\, 17 Sept\n\nJoti Jot — Sri Guru Nanak Dev Ji & Guru Nanak Parivar / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਨਾਨਕ ਦੇਵ ਜੀ ਅਤੇ ਗੁਰੂ ਨਾਨਕ ਪਰਿਵਾਰ\nAssu Vadhi 10 (31 Bhadon\, Sambat 2082) · Puratan Joti Jot commemoration of First Patshah Sri Guru Nanak Dev Ji at Sri Kartarpur Sahib (Assu Vadhi 10\, 1596 Bikrami / 1539 CE)\, honoring Bebe Nanaki\, Mata Sulakhni & Baba Lakhmi Das Ji.\nSources: Puratan Janamsakhi & Mehma Prakash (Assu Vadhi 10\, Sambat 1596 Bikrami · Sri Kartarpur Sahib)\n\nGuru Ghar Heritage — Bebe Nanaki Ji\, Mata Sulakhni Ji & Baba Lakhmi Das Ji / ਗੁਰੂ ਘਰ ਵਿਰਾਸਤ — ਬੇਬੇ ਨਾਨਕੀ ਜੀ\, ਮਾਤਾ ਸੁਲੱਖਣੀ ਜੀ ਅਤੇ ਬਾਬਾ ਲਖਮੀ ਦਾਸ ਜੀ\n31 Bhadon\, Sambat 2082 (On Sri Guru Nanak Dev Ji Joti Jot) · Honoring Sri Guru Nanak Dev Ji’s sacred family: elder sister Bebe Nanaki Ji (first to recognize Guru Nanak’s divinity)\, consort Mata Sulakhni Ji (Batala & Kartarpur Sahib)\, and younger Sahibzada Baba Lakhmi Das Ji.\nSources: Puratan Janamsakhi & Mahan Kosh (Entries: Bebe Nanaki Ji\, Mata Sulakhni Ji & Baba Lakhmi Das Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,GURPURAB\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
