SUMMARY:4 Assu 2082 · Assu Vadhi 14 (Chaudas (Chaturdashi)) (੪ ਅੱਸੂ ੨੦੮੨) — Baba Sri Chand & Bhai Kanhaiya Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 4 Assu\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੪ ਅੱਸੂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Assu Vadhi 14 (Chaudas (Chaturdashi)) · ਅੱਸੂ ਵਦੀ ੧੪ (ਚੌਦਸ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:18 AM\, 21 Sept\n\nJanam Divas — Baba Sri Chand Ji (4 Assu) & Bhai Kanhaiya Ji Remembrance / ਜਨਮ ਦਿਵਸ — ਬਾਬਾ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਚੰਦ ਜੀ (੪ ਅੱਸੂ) ਅਤੇ ਭਾਈ ਘਨ੍ਹੱਈਆ ਜੀ ਯਾਦਗਾਰ\n4 Assu\, Sambat 2082 (Bhadon Sudhi 9 tradition also noted) · Birth anniversary of Baba Sri Chand Ji (elder Sahibzada of Sri Guru Nanak Dev Ji\, Sambat 1551) alongside Assu remembrance of Bhai Kanhaiya Ji\, emblem of universal compassion at Sri Anandpur Sahib.\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Entries: Baba Sri Chand Ji (4 Assu 1551) & Bhai Kanhaiya Ji (Assu 1775))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
