SUMMARY:9 Katak 2082 · Katak Sudhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) (੯ ਕੱਤਕ ੨੦੮੨) — Gurgaddi SGGS Ji · Barsi Sant Jwala Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 9 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੯ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Sudhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) · ਕੱਤਕ ਸੁਦੀ ੪ (ਚੌਥ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:49 AM\, 26 Oct\n\nGurgaddi Divas — Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Takhat Sri Hazur Sahib\, 1708) / ਗੁਰਤਾਗੱਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੀ (ਤਖ਼ਤ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਹਜ਼ੂਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ\, ੧੭੦੮)\nKatak Sudhi 4 (9 Katak\, Sambat 2082) · 317th anniversary of Eternal Guruship bestowed upon Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji by Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji at Nanded (Katak Sudhi 4\, 1765 Bikrami).\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Talauda (Pargana Jind) (Katak Sudhi 4\, Sambat 1765 Bikrami · Nanded\, Godavari)\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Jwala Singh Ji (Harkhowal) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਜਵਾਲਾ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਹਰਖੋਵਾਲ)\nKatak Sudhi 4 (9 Katak\, Sambat 2082) · Annual Barsi of Brahmgyani Sant Baba Jwala Singh Ji Harkhowal (1889–1957 CE)\, luminary of Hoti Mardan Samparda.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 273 · Sukhmani Sahib (Ashtpadi 8))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,GURPURAB\,BARSI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:daily-2025-10-26@calendar.tatkhalsa.in
