SUMMARY:10 Katak 2082 · Katak Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) (੧੦ ਕੱਤਕ ੨੦੮੨) — Joti Jot Guru Gobind Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 10 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੧੦ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) · ਕੱਤਕ ਸੁਦੀ ੫ (ਪੰਚਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 06:06 AM\, 27 Oct\n\nJoti Jot — Sri Guru Gobind Singh Sahib Ji (Sri Hazur Sahib) / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗੋਬਿੰਦ ਸਿੰਘ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਹਜ਼ੂਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\nKatak Sudhi 5 (10 Katak\, Sambat 2082) · Joti Jot commemoration of Tenth Patshah Sri Guru Gobind Singh Sahib Ji at Takhat Sachkhand Sri Hazur Sahib\, Nanded (Katak Sudhi 5\, 1765 Bikrami).\nSources: Sri Gur Sobha (Kavi Sainapati) (Chapter 18 · Katak Sudhi 5\, Sambat 1765 Bikrami)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,GURPURAB
