DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 16 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੧੬ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Sudhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) · ਕੱਤਕ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੦ (ਦਸਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:13 AM\, 1 Nov\n\nJanam Purab — Shiromani Bhagat Namdev Ji / ਜਨਮ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ਼੍ਰੋਮਣੀ ਭਗਤ ਨਾਮਦੇਵ ਜੀ\nKatak Sudhi 11 (16 Katak\, Sambat 2082) · Birth commemoration of Shiromani Bhagat Namdev Ji (1270–1350)\, whose 61 shabads are enshrined in Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Raag Bhairau — Bhagat Namdev Ji) (Ang 1163 · Mai Bauri Mera Ram Bhatar)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
