SUMMARY:29 Katak 2082 · Maghar Vadhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) (੨੯ ਕੱਤਕ ੨੦੮੨) — Barsi Sant Mohan Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 29 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੨੯ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Vadhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) · ਮੱਘਰ ਵਦੀ ੧੦ (ਦਸਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:51 AM\, 15 Nov\n\nBarsi — Sant Giani Mohan Singh Ji Bhindranwale / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਗਿਆਨੀ ਮੋਹਨ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ ਭਿੰਡਰਾਂਵਾਲੇ\nMaghar Vadhi 10 (29 Katak\, Sambat 2082) · Annual Barsi of Sant Giani Mohan Singh Ji Bhindranwale\, renowned Vidvan and Head of Damdami Taksal (Bhindran) who taught hundreds of Gurbani Kathakars.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 595 · Sorath Mahalla 1 (Gurmukh Vidya))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
