SUMMARY:30 Katak 2082 · Maghar Vadhi 11 (Ekadashi) (੩੦ ਕੱਤਕ ੨੦੮੨) — Shaheedi Baba Deep Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 30 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੩੦ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Vadhi 11 (Ekadashi) · ਮੱਘਰ ਵਦੀ ੧੧ (ਇਕਾਦਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 02:39 AM\, 16 Nov\n\nShaheedi Divas — Dhan Dhan Baba Deep Singh Ji Shaheed / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਧੰਨ ਧੰਨ ਬਾਬਾ ਦੀਪ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ ਸ਼ਹੀਦ\n30 Katak\, Sambat 2082 (Sri Amritsar Sahib\, 1757) · Supreme martyrdom of First Jathedar of Damdami Taksal & Shaheedan Misl\, Baba Deep Singh Ji (30 Katak 1814 Bikrami) defending Sachkhand Sri Harmandir Sahib.\nSources: Prachin Panth Prakash (Bhai Rattan Singh Bhangu) (Shaheedi Prasang of Baba Deep Singh Ji · 30 Katak 1814 Bikrami)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI
