SUMMARY:6 Maghar 2082 · Maghar Sudhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੬ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੨) — Barsi Sant Teja Singh Ji Rara
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 6 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੬ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Sudhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਮੱਘਰ ਸੁਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 02:48 PM\, 21 Nov\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Teja Singh Ji (Rara Sahib) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਤੇਜਾ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਰਾੜਾ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\nMaghar Sudhi 1 (6 Maghar\, Sambat 2082) · Annual Barsi of Sant Baba Teja Singh Ji of Gurdwara Karamsar Rara Sahib\, successor to Sant Baba Isher Singh Ji and Sant Baba Kishan Singh Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 262 · Gauri Sukhmani Mahalla 5)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
