SUMMARY:15 Maghar 2082 · Maghar Sudhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) (੧੫ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੨) — Baba Zorawar Singh Ji Janam
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 15 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੧੫ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Sudhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) · ਮੱਘਰ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੦ (ਦਸਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:30 PM\, 30 Nov\n\nParkash Purab — Sahibzada Baba Zorawar Singh Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸਾਹਿਬਜ਼ਾਦਾ ਬਾਬਾ ਜ਼ੋਰਾਵਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\n15 Maghar\, Sambat 2082 · Birth anniversary of third Sahibzada Baba Zorawar Singh Ji at Sri Anandpur Sahib (Sambat 1753 Bikrami).\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Talauda & Guru Kian Sakhian (Maghar\, Sambat 1753 · Sri Anandpur Sahib)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
