SUMMARY:18 Maghar 2082 · Maghar Sudhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) (੧੮ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੨) — Janam Baba Atal Sahib Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 18 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੧੮ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Sudhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) · ਮੱਘਰ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੩ (ਤੇਰਸ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:27 PM\, 3 Dec\n\nJanam Divas — Baba Atal Rai Sahib Ji / ਜਨਮ ਦਿਹਾੜਾ — ਬਾਬਾ ਅਟੱਲ ਰਾਇ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੀ\nMaghar Sudhi 13 (18 Maghar\, Sambat 2082) · Birth commemoration of Baba Atal Rai Ji (1676 Bikrami)\, luminous son of Sri Guru Hargobind Sahib Ji and Mata Nanaki Ji\, honored by the nine-story Gurdwara Baba Atal Sahib.\nSources: Sri Gurpratap Suraj Granth Sahib Ji (Raas 6\, Ansu 38–42 · Janam & Spiritual Glory of Baba Atal Rai Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
