SUMMARY:25 Maghar 2082 · Poh Vadhi 6 (Chhat (Shashthi)) (੨੫ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੨) — Mata Sundri Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 25 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੨੫ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Vadhi 6 (Chhat (Shashthi)) · ਪੋਹ ਵਦੀ ੬ (ਛਠ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 01:48 PM\, 10 Dec\n\nJoti Jot Remembrance — Mata Sundri Ji (Delhi Panthic Leadership) / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ ਯਾਦਗਾਰ — ਮਾਤਾ ਸੁੰਦਰੀ ਜੀ (ਦਿੱਲੀ ਪੰਥਕ ਅਗਵਾਈ)\nMaghar Remembrance (25 Maghar\, Sambat 2082 · Mahan Kosh Note) · Honoring Mata Sundri Ji (Mata of Sahibzada Baba Ajit Singh Ji)\, who guided the Khalsa Panth for nearly four decades from Delhi and commissioned Bhai Mani Singh Ji’s seva at Sri Amritsar Sahib.\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Hukamnamas of Mata Sundri Ji (Entry: Sundri (Mata) · Sambat 1804 Delhi Archive)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
