SUMMARY:29 Maghar 2082 · Poh Vadhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) (੨੯ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੨) — Baba Fateh Singh Ji Janam
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 29 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੨੯ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Vadhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) · ਪੋਹ ਵਦੀ ੧੦ (ਦਸਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 06:51 PM\, 14 Dec\n\nParkash Purab — Sahibzada Baba Fateh Singh Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸਾਹਿਬਜ਼ਾਦਾ ਬਾਬਾ ਫ਼ਤਹਿ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\n29 Maghar\, Sambat 2082 (11 Phagun alternate tradition noted) · Commemorating the birth of youngest Sahibzada Baba Fateh Singh Ji at Sri Anandpur Sahib (Sambat 1755 Bikrami)\, symbol of fearless Khalsa sovereignty.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Multani Sindhi & Guru Kian Sakhian (Sambat 1755 · Sri Anandpur Sahib Birth Record)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
