SUMMARY:1 Poh 2082 · Poh Vadhi 12 (Dwadashi) (੧ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੨) — Poh Sangrand · Barsi Sant Harnam Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 1 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੧ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Vadhi 12 (Dwadashi) · ਪੋਹ ਵਦੀ ੧੨ (ਦੁਆਦਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 11:59 PM\, 16 Dec\nSangrand: 1 Poh (ਪੋਹ ਸੰਗਰਾਂਦ) · Sankranti at 10:03 PM\, 15 Dec IST\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Harnam Singh Ji (Rampur Khera Wale) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਹਰਨਾਮ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਰਾਮਪੁਰ ਖੇੜਾ ਵਾਲੇ)\nPoh Vadhi 12 (1 Poh\, Sambat 2082) · Annual Barsi of Sant Baba Harnam Singh Ji Rampur Khera Wale (1897–1983 CE)\, whose spiritual biography "Se Kinehiya" has inspired seekers globally.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1102 · Maru Vaar Mahalla 5 (Dakhne — Inspiration of "Se Kinehiya"))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
