SUMMARY:5 Poh 2082 · Poh Sudhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੫ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੨) — Mata Jito Ji Joti Jot
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 5 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੫ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Sudhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਪੋਹ ਸੁਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:13 AM\, 21 Dec\n\nJoti Jot Divas — Mata Jito Ji (Sri Anandpur Sahib) / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ ਦਿਵਸ — ਮਾਤਾ ਜੀਤੋ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਨੰਦਪੁਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\n5 Poh\, Sambat 2082 (Poh Sudhi 5\, Sambat 1757) · Passing of Mata Jito Ji (mother of Sahibzade Baba Jujhar Singh Ji\, Baba Zorawar Singh Ji & Baba Fateh Singh Ji) at Sri Anandpur Sahib (Agampura).\nSources: Bhatt Vahi & Guru Kian Sakhian (5 Poh\, Sambat 1757 · Agampura\, Sri Anandpur Sahib)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
