DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 6 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੬ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Sudhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਪੋਹ ਸੁਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:13 AM\, 21 Dec\n\nShaheedi Hafta Begins — Qila Anandgarh Chhodna & Sarsa Nadi Vichhora / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਹਫ਼ਤਾ ਆਰੰਭ — ਕਿਲ੍ਹਾ ਅਨੰਦਗੜ੍ਹ ਛੱਡਣਾ ਅਤੇ ਸਰਸਾ ਨਦੀ ਵਿਛੋੜਾ\n6–7 Poh\, Sambat 2082 (Anandpur Sahib & Sarsa\, 1704) · Evacuation of Sri Anandpur Sahib (6 Poh 1761 Bikrami) and Battle of Sarsa Nadi (7 Poh) with Shaheedi of Bhai Uday Singh Ji & Bhai Bachittar Singh Ji.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Multani Sindhi & Guru Kian Sakhian (6–7 Poh\, Sambat 1761 Bikrami · Anandpur & Sarsa Nadi)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
