DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20251223
SUMMARY:7 Poh 2082 · Poh Sudhi 2 (Dooj (Dwitiya)) (੭ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੨) — Sarsa Nadi & Bhai Uday/Bachittar Singh
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 7 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੭ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Sudhi 2 (Dooj (Dwitiya)) · ਪੋਹ ਸੁਦੀ ੨ (ਦੂਜ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 10:53 AM\, 22 Dec\n\nShaheedi Hafta — Sarsa Nadi Vichhora\, Bhai Uday Singh Ji & Bhai Bachittar Singh Ji / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਹਫ਼ਤਾ — ਸਰਸਾ ਨਦੀ ਵਿਛੋੜਾ\, ਭਾਈ ਉਦੈ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ ਅਤੇ ਭਾਈ ਬਚਿੱਤਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\n7 Poh\, Sambat 2082 (Parivar Vichhora & Shahi Tibbi) · Separation of Guru Gobind Singh Ji’s family at the flooded Sarsa River (Parivar Vichhora)\, Asa Di Vaar amid battle\, and the legendary martyrdom of Bhai Uday Singh Ji (Shahi Tibbi) and Bhai Bachittar Singh Ji (Malikpur/Kotla Nihang).\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Multani Sindhi & Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Ayan 2\, Ansu 1–12 · Sarsa Nadi\, Shahi Tibbi & Kotla Nihang (7 Poh 1761))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:daily-2025-12-23@calendar.tatkhalsa.in
DTSTAMP:20260314T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20251223
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20251224
SUMMARY:8 Poh 2082 · Poh Sudhi 3 (Teej (Tritiya)) (੮ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੨) — Vadde Sahibzade · Chamkaur · Three Panj Pyare (Chamkaur)
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 8 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੮ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Sudhi 3 (Teej (Tritiya)) · ਪੋਹ ਸੁਦੀ ੩ (ਤੀਜ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:15 PM\, 23 Dec\n\nShaheedi — Vadde Sahibzade (Baba Ajit Singh & Baba Jujhar Singh Ji) at Sri Chamkaur Sahib / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ — ਵੱਡੇ ਸਾਹਿਬਜ਼ਾਦੇ (ਬਾਬਾ ਅਜੀਤ ਸਿੰਘ ਤੇ ਬਾਬਾ ਜੁਝਾਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ) ਸ੍ਰੀ ਚਮਕੌਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ\n8 Poh\, Sambat 2082 (Garhi Chamkaur\, 1761 Bikrami) · Martyrdom of Sahibzada Baba Ajit Singh Ji\, Sahibzada Baba Jujhar Singh Ji\, three Panj Pyare (Bhai Himmat Singh\, Mohkam Singh\, Sahib Singh Ji)\, and 40 Singhs of Chamkaur.\nSources: Sri Dasam Granth Sahib Ji (Zafarnama) (Verse 19 · Gursanah Cheh Kaare Kunad Chehl Nar)\n\nShaheedi Divas — Three Panj Pyare (Bhai Himmat Singh\, Bhai Mohkam Singh & Bhai Sahib Singh Ji) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਤਿੰਨ ਪੰਜ ਪਿਆਰੇ (ਭਾਈ ਹਿੰਮਤ ਸਿੰਘ\, ਭਾਈ ਮੋਹਕਮ ਸਿੰਘ ਅਤੇ ਭਾਈ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ)\n8 Poh\, Sambat 2082 (Battle of Sri Chamkaur Sahib) · Supreme martyrdom of three of the original Panj Pyare—Bhai Himmat Singh Ji (Jagannath Puri)\, Bhai Mohkam Singh Ji (Dwarka)\, and Bhai Sahib Singh Ji (Bidar)—alongside the Vadde Sahibzade and 40 Singhs at Garhi Chamkaur.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Talauda & Prachin Panth Prakash (8 Poh\, Sambat 1761 · Garhi Sri Chamkaur Sahib Martyrs)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
