SUMMARY:9 Poh 2082 · Poh Sudhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) (੯ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੨) — Barsi Baba Hazura Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 9 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੯ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Sudhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) · ਪੋਹ ਸੁਦੀ ੪ (ਚੌਥ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 01:13 PM\, 24 Dec\n\nBarsi — Singhsahib Baba Hazura Singh Ji (Jathedar Takhat Sri Hazur Sahib) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸਿੰਘ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਬਾਬਾ ਹਜ਼ੂਰਾ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਜਥੇਦਾਰ ਤਖ਼ਤ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਹਜ਼ੂਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\nPoh Sudhi 4 (9 Poh\, Sambat 2082) · Annual Barsi of Singhsahib Baba Hazura Singh Ji\, revered Jathedar of Takhat Sachkhand Sri Hazur Abchal Nagar Sahib who safeguarded Puratan Hazuri Maryada.\nSources: Takhat Sachkhand Sri Hazur Sahib Archival Record (Jathedar Lineage & Puratan Hazuri Maryada Chronicle)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,BARSI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
