SUMMARY:10 Poh 2082 · Poh Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) (੧੦ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੨) — Basant Ruth Arambh
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 10 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੧੦ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) · ਪੋਹ ਸੁਦੀ ੫ (ਪੰਚਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 01:44 PM\, 25 Dec\n\nBasant Ruth Arambh (Inauguration of Raag Basant Kirtan) / ਬਸੰਤ ਰੁੱਤ ਆਰੰਭ (ਰਾਗ ਬਸੰਤ ਕੀਰਤਨ ਦੀ ਸ਼ੁਰੂਆਤ)\nPoh Sudhi 5 (10 Poh\, Sambat 2082) · Puratan Gurdwara Maryada marking the commencement of Raag Basant Kirtan (Lohri / Maghi eve) through Holla Mohalla at Sachkhand Sri Harmandir Sahib and all Takhts.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1176 · Raag Basant Mahalla 3 (Basant Ki Vaar & Seasonal Renewal))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
