SUMMARY:19 Poh 2082 · Poh Puranmashi (੧੯ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੨) — Barsi Sant Attar Singh Ji Reru
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 19 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੧੯ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਪੋਹ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:34 PM\, 3 Jan\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Attar Singh Ji (Reru Sahib Wale) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਅਤਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਰੇਰੂ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਵਾਲੇ)\nPoh Puranmashi (19 Poh\, Sambat 2082) · Annual Barsi of Brahmgyani Sant Baba Attar Singh Ji Reru Sahib (1867–1927 CE)\, whose spiritual grace transformed Reru Sahib and inspired Sant Baba Isher Singh Ji Rara Sahib.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 272 · Sukhmani Sahib (Ashtpadi 8))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
