SUMMARY:25 Poh 2082 · Magh Vadhi 7 (Saptami) (੨੫ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੨) — Bhagat Ramanand Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 25 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੨੫ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Magh Vadhi 7 (Saptami) · ਮਾਘ ਵਦੀ ੭ (ਸਪਤਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 08:26 AM\, 10 Jan\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Ramanand Ji (SGGS Ang 1195) / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਰਾਮਾਨੰਦ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅੰਗ ੧੧੯੫)\nMagh Vadhi 7 (25 Poh\, Sambat 2082 · Traditional) · Traditional Magh Vadhi 7 observance of Bhagat Ramanand Ji\, whose sublime Raag Basant Shabad ("Kat jaaeeai re ghar laago rang") graces Ang 1195 of Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1195 · Raag Basant\, Bhagat Ramanand Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
