SUMMARY:9 Phagun 2082 · Phagun Sudhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) (੯ ਫੱਗਣ ੨੦੮੨) — Saka Sri Nankana Sahib
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 9 Phagun\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੯ ਫੱਗਣ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Phagun Sudhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) · ਫੱਗਣ ਸੁਦੀ ੪ (ਚੌਥ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 01:03 PM\, 21 Feb\n\nShaheedi Saka Sri Nankana Sahib (Bhai Lachhman Singh Dharowali & Jatha) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਸਾਕਾ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਨਨਕਾਣਾ ਸਾਹਿਬ (ਭਾਈ ਲਛਮਣ ਸਿੰਘ ਧਾਰੋਵਾਲੀ ਅਤੇ ਜਥਾ)\n9 Phagun\, Sambat 2082 (21 Feb 1921) · Martyrdom of Bhai Lachhman Singh Dharowali\, Bhai Dalip Singh\, and over 130 peaceful Akali Singhs liberating Gurdwara Janam Asthan\, Sri Nankana Sahib.\nSources: Panthic Historical Record · Gurdwara Sudhar Lehar (Phagun 1977 Bikrami (Feb 1921) · Sri Nankana Sahib Saka)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
