SUMMARY:20 Phagun 2082 · Chet Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੨੦ ਫੱਗਣ ੨੦੮੨) — Holla Mohalla
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 20 Phagun\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੨੦ ਫੱਗਣ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Chet Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਚੇਤ ਵਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 04:51 PM\, 4 Mar\n\nHolla Mohalla (Sri Anandpur Sahib · Chet Vadhi 1) / ਹੋਲਾ ਮਹੱਲਾ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਨੰਦਪੁਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ · ਚੇਤ ਵਦੀ ੧)\nChet Vadhi 1 (20 Phagun\, Sambat 2082) · Khalsa martial festival at Sri Anandpur Sahib on Chet Vadhi 1 (Wednesday\, 4 March 2026 / 20 Phagun\, Sambat 2082).\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Rut 4\, Ansu 20–24 · Holgarh Fort\, Sri Anandpur Sahib)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
