DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260311
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260312
SUMMARY:27 Phagun 2082 · Chet Vadhi 8 (Ashtami) (੨੭ ਫੱਗਣ ੨੦੮੨) — Delhi Fateh Divas
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 27 Phagun\, Bikrami Sambat 2082 (੨੭ ਫੱਗਣ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੨)\nLunar Tithi: Chet Vadhi 8 (Ashtami) · ਚੇਤ ਵਦੀ ੮ (ਅਸ਼ਟਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 04:22 AM\, 12 Mar\n\nDelhi Fateh Divas — Baba Baghel Singh & Sardar Jassa Singh Ahluwalia (1783) / ਦਿੱਲੀ ਫ਼ਤਹਿ ਦਿਵਸ — ਬਾਬਾ ਬਘੇਲ ਸਿੰਘ ਅਤੇ ਸਰਦਾਰ ਜੱਸਾ ਸਿੰਘ ਆਹਲੂਵਾਲੀਆ (੧੭੮੩)\n27 Phagun\, Sambat 2082 (Red Fort\, 11 Mar 1783) · Commemoration of the Khalsa conquest of Delhi (11 March 1783) by Baba Baghel Singh\, Sardar Jassa Singh Ahluwalia\, and Sardar Jassa Singh Ramgarhia\, establishing historic Delhi Gurdwaras.\nSources: Prachin Panth Prakash & Panthic Misl Records (11 March 1783 (Phagun 1839 Bikrami) · Delhi Fateh & Gurdwara Construction)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
