DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 20 Chet\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੨੦ ਚੇਤ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Chet Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਚੇਤ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 07:44 AM\, 2 Apr\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Pipa Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਪੀਪਾ ਜੀ\nChet Puranmashi (20 Chet\, Sambat 2083) · Commemoration of Bhagat Pipa Ji on Chet Puranmashi (Ang 695 of Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Raag Dhanasri — Bhagat Pipa Ji) (Ang 695 · Jo Brahmande Soi Pinde)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
