SUMMARY:25 Chet 2083 · Vaisakh Vadhi 5 (Panchmi) (੨੫ ਚੇਤ ੨੦੮੩) — Parkash Guru Tegh Bahadur Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 25 Chet\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੨੫ ਚੇਤ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Vaisakh Vadhi 5 (Panchmi) · ਵੈਸਾਖ ਵਦੀ ੫ (ਪੰਚਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 04:37 PM\, 7 Apr\n\nParkash Purab — Sri Guru Tegh Bahadur Sahib Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਤੇਗ਼ ਬਹਾਦਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੀ\nVaisakh Vadhi 5 · 25 Chet\, Sambat 2083 (Lunar & Solar Alignment) · Parkash Purab of Ninth Patshah Sri Guru Tegh Bahadur Sahib Ji — a rare Sambat 2083 alignment where lunar Vaisakh Vadhi 5 and solar 25 Chet coincide.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Talauda (Pargana Jind) (Vaisakh Vadhi 5\, Sambat 1678 Bikrami · Guru Ke Mahal\, Amritsar)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,GURPURAB
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
