SUMMARY:27 Chet 2083 · Vaisakh Vadhi 7 (Saptami) (੨੭ ਚੇਤ ੨੦੮੩) — Parkash Guru Arjan Dev Ji · Baba Jujhar Singh Ji Janam
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 27 Chet\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੨੭ ਚੇਤ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Vaisakh Vadhi 7 (Saptami) · ਵੈਸਾਖ ਵਦੀ ੭ (ਸਪਤਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:22 PM\, 9 Apr\n\nParkash Purab — Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji & Sahibzada Baba Jujhar Singh Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਅਰਜਨ ਦੇਵ ਜੀ ਅਤੇ ਸਾਹਿਬਜ਼ਾਦਾ ਬਾਬਾ ਜੁਝਾਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\nVaisakh Vadhi 7 · 27 Chet\, Sambat 2083 (Lunar & Solar Alignment) · Parkash Purab of Fifth Patshah Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji (exact alignment of Vaisakh Vadhi 7 & 27 Chet) and Sahibzada Baba Jujhar Singh Ji.\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Raas 2\, Ansu 26 · Parkash of Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji)\n\nParkash Purab — Sahibzada Baba Jujhar Singh Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸਾਹਿਬਜ਼ਾਦਾ ਬਾਬਾ ਜੁਝਾਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\n27 Chet\, Sambat 2083 (Chet / Vaisakh Sambat 1748) · Birth anniversary of second Sahibzada Baba Jujhar Singh Ji at Sri Anandpur Sahib (Sambat 1748 Bikrami)\, who fought beside Baba Ajit Singh Ji at Sri Chamkaur Sahib.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Talauda & Guru Kian Sakhian (Sambat 1748 · Sri Anandpur Sahib Birth Record)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,GURPURAB
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
