SUMMARY:11 Vaisakh 2083 · Vaisakh Sudhi 8 (Ashtami) (੧੧ ਵੈਸਾਖ ੨੦੮੩) — Bhagat Jaidev Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 11 Vaisakh\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੧੧ ਵੈਸਾਖ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Vaisakh Sudhi 8 (Ashtami) · ਵੈਸਾਖ ਸੁਦੀ ੮ (ਅਸ਼ਟਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 07:24 PM\, 24 Apr\n\nRemembrance — Bhagat Jaidev Ji (SGGS Ang 526\, 1106 · Mahan Kosh Note) / ਯਾਦਗਾਰ — ਭਗਤ ਜੈਦੇਵ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅੰਗ ੫੨੬\, ੧੧੦੬ · ਮਹਾਨ ਕੋਸ਼ ਨੋਟ)\nVaisakh Commemoration (11 Vaisakh\, Sambat 2083 · Exact date unrecorded) · Honoring Bhagat Jaidev Ji (12th-century saint-poet of Kindubilva\, Bengal)\, whose two Shabads in Raag Gujri (Ang 526) and Raag Maru (Ang 1106) are enshrined in Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 526 & 1106 · Raag Gujri & Maru\, Bhagat Jaidev Ji) | Mahan Kosh (Bhai Kahn Singh Nabha) (Entry: Jaidev (ਜੈਦੇਵ) · Historical Chronology Note)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
