DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 4 Harh\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੪ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Jeth Sudhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) · ਜੇਠ ਸੁਦੀ ੪ (ਚੌਥ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 07:01 PM\, 18 Jun\n\nShaheedi Divas — Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji (Shuddh Jeth Sudhi 4) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਅਰਜਨ ਦੇਵ ਜੀ (ਸ਼ੁੱਧ ਜੇਠ ਸੁਦੀ ੪)\nShuddh Jeth Sudhi 4 (4 Harh\, Sambat 2083 · Adhik Jeth Year) · Puratan Shaheedi Divas of Fifth Patshah Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji observed on Shuddh Jeth Sudhi 4 (18 June 2026) in the Adhik Jeth intercalary year Sambat 2083.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Raag Asa — Mahalla 5) (Ang 394 · Tera Kiya Meetha Lage) | Bhatt Vahi Multani Sindhi (Jeth Sudhi 4\, Sambat 1663 Bikrami · Lahore Shaheedi)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
