SUMMARY:15 Harh 2083 · Jeth Puranmashi (੧੫ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ੨੦੮੩) — Bhagat Kabir Ji · Ranjit Singh · Maharaja Ranjit Singh Barsi
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 15 Harh\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੧੫ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Jeth Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਜੇਠ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 05:28 AM\, 30 Jun\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Kabir Ji & Barsi Maharaja Ranjit Singh Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਕਬੀਰ ਜੀ ਅਤੇ ਬਰਸੀ ਮਹਾਰਾਜਾ ਰਣਜੀਤ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\nShuddh Jeth Puranmashi (15 Harh\, Sambat 2083) · Parkash Purab of Shiromani Bhagat Kabir Ji (Shuddh Jeth Puranmashi) and annual Barsi of Maharaja Ranjit Singh Ji (15 Harh).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Raag Prabhati — Bhagat Kabir Ji) (Ang 1349 · Awal Allah Noor Upaya)\n\nBarsi — Sher-e-Punjab Maharaja Ranjit Singh Ji (Sarkar-e-Khalsa) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸ਼ੇਰ-ਏ-ਪੰਜਾਬ ਮਹਾਰਾਜਾ ਰਣਜੀਤ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਸਰਕਾਰ-ਏ-ਖ਼ਾਲਸਾ)\n15 Harh\, Sambat 2083 (15 Harh\, Sambat 1896) · Annual Barsi of Sher-e-Punjab Maharaja Ranjit Singh Ji (1780–1839)\, founder of the sovereign Khalsa Empire (Sarkar-e-Khalsa) who gold-plated Sri Harmandir Sahib.\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Umdat-ut-Tawarikh (Entry: Ranjit Singh Maharaja · 15 Harh\, Sambat 1896 (Lahore))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,Puranmashi\,KHALSA\,BARSI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
