DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 1 Sawan\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੧ ਸਾਵਣ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Harh Sudhi 2 (Dooj (Dwitiya)) · ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ਸੁਦੀ ੨ (ਦੂਜ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 08:55 AM\, 16 Jul\nSangrand: 1 Sawan (ਸਾਵਣ ਸੰਗਰਾਂਦ) · Sankranti at 04:58 PM\, 16 Jul IST\n\nShaheedi Divas — Shaheed Bhai Taru Singh Ji / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਸ਼ਹੀਦ ਭਾਈ ਤਾਰੂ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\n1 Sawan\, Sambat 2083 (Sawan Sangrand) · Martyrdom of Shaheed Bhai Taru Singh Ji (1 Sawan 1802 Bikrami / 1745) at Lahore for preserving his Kes.\nSources: Prachin Panth Prakash (Bhai Rattan Singh Bhangu) (Shaheedi of Bhai Taru Singh Ji · 1 Sawan 1802 Bikrami)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,Sangrand\,SHAHEEDI
