SUMMARY:13 Bhadon 2083 · Bhadon Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੧੩ ਭਾਦੋਂ ੨੦੮੩) — Adi Bir & 11 Bhatts
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 13 Bhadon\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੧੩ ਭਾਦੋਂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਵਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:59 AM\, 29 Aug\n\nAdi Bir Completion Colophon (Kartarpur Bir) & All 11 Bhatt Sahibaan / ਆਦਿ ਬੀੜ ਸੰਪੂਰਨਤਾ ਹਵਾਲਾ (ਕਰਤਾਰਪੁਰੀ ਬੀੜ) ਅਤੇ ੧੧ ਭੱਟ ਸਾਹਿਬਾਨ\nBhadon Vadhi 1 (13 Bhadon\, Sambat 2083) · Completion anniversary of the Kartarpur Adi Bir (Bhadon Vadhi 1\, 1661 Bikrami) and commemoration of all 11 Bhatt Sahibaan.\nSources: Kartarpur Adi Bir Manuscript Colophon (Sambat 1661 Miti Bhadon Vadi 1 Pothi Likhi Pahunche)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
