SUMMARY:31 Bhadon 2083 · Bhadon Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) (੩੧ ਭਾਦੋਂ ੨੦੮੩) — Bhai Gurdas Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 31 Bhadon\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੩੧ ਭਾਦੋਂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਸੁਦੀ ੫ (ਪੰਚਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:01 AM\, 16 Sept\n\nJoti Jot — Bhai Gurdas Ji / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ — ਭਾਈ ਗੁਰਦਾਸ ਜੀ\nBhadon Sudhi 5 (31 Bhadon\, Sambat 2083) · Annual commemoration of Bhai Gurdas Ji (scribe of Adi Granth Sahib Ji) on Bhadon Sudhi 5.\nSources: Bhai Gurdas Ji Vaaran (Vaar 1\, Pauri 27 · Satgur Nanak Pragatia)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
