SUMMARY:4 Assu 2083 · Bhadon Sudhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) (੪ ਅੱਸੂ ੨੦੮੩) — Baba Sri Chand & Bhai Kanhaiya Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 4 Assu\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੪ ਅੱਸੂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Sudhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਸੁਦੀ ੯ (ਨੌਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 05:53 PM\, 20 Sept\n\nJanam Divas — Baba Sri Chand Ji (4 Assu) & Bhai Kanhaiya Ji Remembrance / ਜਨਮ ਦਿਵਸ — ਬਾਬਾ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਚੰਦ ਜੀ (੪ ਅੱਸੂ) ਅਤੇ ਭਾਈ ਘਨ੍ਹੱਈਆ ਜੀ ਯਾਦਗਾਰ\n4 Assu\, Sambat 2083 (Bhadon Sudhi 9 tradition also noted) · Birth anniversary of Baba Sri Chand Ji (elder Sahibzada of Sri Guru Nanak Dev Ji\, Sambat 1551) alongside Assu remembrance of Bhai Kanhaiya Ji\, emblem of universal compassion at Sri Anandpur Sahib.\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Entries: Baba Sri Chand Ji (4 Assu 1551) & Bhai Kanhaiya Ji (Assu 1775))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
