SUMMARY:10 Assu 2083 · Bhadon Puranmashi (੧੦ ਅੱਸੂ ੨੦੮੩) — Baba Sundar Ji (Ramkali Sadd)
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 10 Assu\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੧੦ ਅੱਸੂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 10:20 PM\, 26 Sept\n\nGursikh Bani-kar — Baba Sundar Ji (Ramkali Sadd\, SGGS Ang 923) / ਗੁਰਸਿੱਖ ਬਾਣੀਕਾਰ — ਬਾਬਾ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਜੀ (ਰਾਮਕਲੀ ਸਦੁ\, ਅੰਗ ੯੨੩)\nBhadon Puranmashi (10 Assu\, Sambat 2083 · Guru Amar Das Ji Joti Jot) · Commemorating Baba Sundar Ji (great-grandson of Sri Guru Amar Das Ji) on Bhadon Puranmashi\, who authored the sacred Bani Ramkali Sadd (Ang 923) chronicling Guru Amar Das Ji’s Joti Jot and Gurgaddi to Guru Ram Das Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 923–924 · Ramkali Sadd (Baba Sundar Ji))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,Puranmashi\,KHALSA
