SUMMARY:14 Katak 2083 · Katak Vadhi 5 (Panchmi) (੧੪ ਕੱਤਕ ੨੦੮੩) — Saka Sri Panja Sahib
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 14 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੧੪ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Vadhi 5 (Panchmi) · ਕੱਤਕ ਵਦੀ ੫ (ਪੰਚਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 07:26 PM\, 30 Oct\n\nShaheedi Saka Sri Panja Sahib (Bhai Partap Singh & Bhai Karam Singh Ji) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਸਾਕਾ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪੰਜਾ ਸਾਹਿਬ (ਭਾਈ ਪ੍ਰਤਾਪ ਸਿੰਘ ਤੇ ਭਾਈ ਕਰਮ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ)\nKatak Vadhi 5 (14 Katak\, Sambat 2083) · Martyrdom of Bhai Partap Singh Ji\, Bhai Karam Singh Ji\, and the Sangat who halted a train at Hasan Abdal (1922) to serve Langar to Gurdwara Reform prisoners.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1412 · Salok Vaaran Te Vadhik (Mahalla 1)) | Panthic Historical Record · Gurdwara Sudhar Lehar (14 Katak 1979 Bikrami (30 Oct 1922) · Hasan Abdal Railway Station Saka)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
