DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 9 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੯ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਕੱਤਕ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 08:25 PM\, 24 Nov\n\n557th Parkash Purab — Sri Guru Nanak Dev Ji / ੫੫੭ਵਾਂ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਨਾਨਕ ਦੇਵ ਜੀ\nKatak Puranmashi (9 Maghar\, Sambat 2083) · Sacred 557th Parkash Purab of Jagat Guru Sri Guru Nanak Dev Ji\, observed across the Panth on Katak Puranmashi (9 Maghar\, Sambat 2083).\nSources: Bhai Gurdas Ji — Vaaran (Vaar 1\, Pauri 27 · Advent of Satguru Nanak) | Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Nanak Prakash) (Purbaradh\, Adhyay 1 · Katak Puranmashi Tradition at Nankana Sahib) | Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1389 · Swaiye Mahalle Pehle Ke (Bhatt Kal))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
