SUMMARY:17 Maghar 2083 · Maghar Vadhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) (੧੭ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੩) — Baba Budha Ji Joti Jot
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 17 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੧੭ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Vadhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) · ਮੱਘਰ ਵਦੀ ੯ (ਨੌਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 10:54 PM\, 2 Dec\n\nJoti Jot Divas — Brahmgyani Baba Budha Ji (Ramdas) / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ ਦਿਵਸ — ਬ੍ਰਹਮਗਿਆਨੀ ਬਾਬਾ ਬੁੱਢਾ ਜੀ (ਰਮਦਾਸ)\n17 Maghar\, Sambat 2083 (Maghar Sudhi 4 tradition) · Passing of Brahmgyani Baba Budha Ji at Ramdas (Sambat 1688 Bikrami) in the physical presence of Sixth Patshah Sri Guru Hargobind Sahib Ji.\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Raas 6\, Ansu 42–46 · Baba Budha Ji Joti Jot at Ramdas)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
