DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 22 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੨੨ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Vadhi 14 (Chaudas (Chaturdashi)) · ਮੱਘਰ ਵਦੀ ੧੪ (ਚੌਦਸ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 04:14 AM\, 8 Dec\n\nJanam Divas — Bhai Sahib Singh Ji (Panj Pyare) / ਜਨਮ ਦਿਵਸ — ਭਾਈ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਪੰਜ ਪਿਆਰੇ)\n22 Maghar\, Sambat 2083 · Birth anniversary of Bhai Sahib Singh Ji of Bidar (Karnataka)\, fifth of the Panj Pyare blessed at Vaisakhi 1699 and Shaheed at Sri Chamkaur Sahib.\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Bhatt Vahi (Entry: Sahib Singh (Panj Pyare) · Bidar & Chamkaur Sahib)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
