SUMMARY:25 Maghar 2083 · Maghar Sudhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੨੫ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੩) — Mata Sundri Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 25 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੨੫ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Sudhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਮੱਘਰ ਸੁਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 08:48 AM\, 10 Dec\n\nJoti Jot Remembrance — Mata Sundri Ji (Delhi Panthic Leadership) / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ ਯਾਦਗਾਰ — ਮਾਤਾ ਸੁੰਦਰੀ ਜੀ (ਦਿੱਲੀ ਪੰਥਕ ਅਗਵਾਈ)\nMaghar Remembrance (25 Maghar\, Sambat 2083 · Mahan Kosh Note) · Honoring Mata Sundri Ji (Mata of Sahibzada Baba Ajit Singh Ji)\, who guided the Khalsa Panth for nearly four decades from Delhi and commissioned Bhai Mani Singh Ji’s seva at Sri Amritsar Sahib.\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Hukamnamas of Mata Sundri Ji (Entry: Sundri (Mata) · Sambat 1804 Delhi Archive)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
