SUMMARY:9 Poh 2083 · Poh Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੯ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੩) — Barsi Baba Thakur Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 9 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੯ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਪੋਹ ਵਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:09 AM\, 25 Dec\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Thakur Singh Ji (Damdami Taksal) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਠਾਕੁਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਦਮਦਮੀ ਟਕਸਾਲ)\nPoh Vadhi 1 (9 Poh\, Sambat 2083) · Annual Barsi of Sant Baba Thakur Singh Ji (1915–2004 CE)\, steadfast caretaker Jathedar of Damdami Taksal (Mehta Chowk) and pillar of Panthic Chardi Kala.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 282 · Sukhmani Sahib (Ashtpadi 15))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,BARSI
