SUMMARY:14 Magh 2083 · Magh Vadhi 6 (Chhat (Shashthi)) (੧੪ ਮਾਘ ੨੦੮੩) — Janam Baba Deep Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 14 Magh\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੧੪ ਮਾਘ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Magh Vadhi 6 (Chhat (Shashthi)) · ਮਾਘ ਵਦੀ ੬ (ਛਠ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:56 AM\, 28 Jan\n\nJanam Divas — Dhan Dhan Baba Deep Singh Ji Shaheed / ਜਨਮ ਦਿਹਾੜਾ — ਧੰਨ ਧੰਨ ਬਾਬਾ ਦੀਪ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ ਸ਼ਹੀਦ\nMagh Vadhi 6 (14 Magh\, Sambat 2083) · Birth commemoration of Baba Deep Singh Ji Shaheed (14 Magh\, 1738 Bikrami / 1682 CE) at Pahuwind (Tarn Taran)\, master scribe of Damdami Bir and warrior-saint of the Khalsa.\nSources: Prachin Panth Prakash & Tawarikh Guru Khalsa (14 Magh 1738 Bikrami · Birth at Pahuwind & Damdama Sahib Scribe Seva) | Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1364 · Salok Kabir Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
