SUMMARY:16 Magh 2083 · Magh Vadhi 8 (Ashtami) (੧੬ ਮਾਘ ੨੦੮੩) — Bhagat Ramanand Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 16 Magh\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੧੬ ਮਾਘ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Magh Vadhi 8 (Ashtami) · ਮਾਘ ਵਦੀ ੮ (ਅਸ਼ਟਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 05:00 AM\, 30 Jan\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Ramanand Ji (SGGS Ang 1195) / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਰਾਮਾਨੰਦ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅੰਗ ੧੧੯੫)\nMagh Vadhi 7 (16 Magh\, Sambat 2083 · Traditional) · Traditional Magh Vadhi 7 observance of Bhagat Ramanand Ji\, whose sublime Raag Basant Shabad ("Kat jaaeeai re ghar laago rang") graces Ang 1195 of Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1195 · Raag Basant\, Bhagat Ramanand Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
