SUMMARY:19 Magh 2083 · Magh Vadhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) (੧੯ ਮਾਘ ੨੦੮੩) — Barsi Sant Attar Singh Ji Mastuana
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 19 Magh\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੧੯ ਮਾਘ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Magh Vadhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) · ਮਾਘ ਵਦੀ ੧੦ (ਦਸਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 08:43 AM\, 1 Feb\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Attar Singh Ji (Mastuana Sahib) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਅਤਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਮਸਤੂਆਣਾ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\nMagh Vadhi 10 (19 Magh\, Sambat 2083) · Annual Barsi of Sant Baba Attar Singh Ji Mastuana Sahib (1866–1927 CE)\, towering pioneer of Amrit Prachar\, Gurmat Vidyalayas\, and Nirmala-Panthic revival.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 749 · Suhi Mahalla 5) | Jeevan Charitar Sant Attar Singh Ji (Sant Teja Singh M.A.) (Hazur Sahib Tapasya & Mastuana Sahib Gurmat Vidya Mission)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
