SUMMARY:4 Phagun 2083 · Magh Sudhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) (੪ ਫੱਗਣ ੨੦੮੩) — Barsi Sant Sundar Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 4 Phagun\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੪ ਫੱਗਣ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Magh Sudhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) · ਮਾਘ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੦ (ਦਸਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 08:21 PM\, 16 Feb\n\nBarsi — Sant Giani Sundar Singh Ji Bhindranwale / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਗਿਆਨੀ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ ਭਿੰਡਰਾਂਵਾਲੇ\nMagh Sudhi 10 (4 Phagun\, Sambat 2083) · Annual Barsi of Vidya Martand Sant Giani Sundar Singh Ji Bhindranwale (1883–1930 CE)\, Eleventh Head of Damdami Taksal and master teacher of Gurbani Arth & Santhia.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 356 · Asa Mahalla 1)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,BARSI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
