SUMMARY:7 Phagun 2083 · Magh Sudhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) (੭ ਫੱਗਣ ੨੦੮੩) — Parkash Guru Har Rai Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 7 Phagun\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੭ ਫੱਗਣ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Magh Sudhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) · ਮਾਘ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੩ (ਤੇਰਸ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 11:15 AM\, 19 Feb\n\nParkash Purab — Sri Guru Har Rai Sahib Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਹਰਿ ਰਾਇ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੀ\nMagh Sudhi 13 (7 Phagun\, Sambat 2083) · Parkash Purab of the Seventh Patshah\, embodiment of compassion\, ecological stewardship\, and Gurbani fidelity (Kiratpur Sahib\, 1686 Bikrami).\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Raas 9\, Ansu 1 · Kiratpur Sahib Parkash & Dawaakhana Tradition)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
