SUMMARY:8 Phagun 2083 · Magh Puranmashi (੮ ਫੱਗਣ ੨੦੮੩) — Parkash Bhagat Ravidas Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 8 Phagun\, Bikrami Sambat 2083 (੮ ਫੱਗਣ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੩)\nLunar Tithi: Magh Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਮਾਘ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 04:54 AM\, 21 Feb\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Ravidas Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਰਵਿਦਾਸ ਜੀ\nMagh Puranmashi (8 Phagun\, Sambat 2083) · Commemoration of Bhagat Ravidas Ji\, whose 41 hymns in Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji envision Begampura\, the city without sorrow.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 345 · Raag Gauri Bani Bhagat Ravidas Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
