SUMMARY:1 Chet 2084 · Phagun Sudhi 7 (Saptami) (੧ ਚੇਤ ੨੦੮੪) — Chet Sangrand · Sambat 2084 New Year · Akali Baba Phula Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 1 Chet\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੧ ਚੇਤ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Phagun Sudhi 7 (Saptami) · ਫੱਗਣ ਸੁਦੀ ੭ (ਸਪਤਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 10:52 AM\, 15 Mar\nSangrand: 1 Chet (ਚੇਤ ਸੰਗਰਾਂਦ) · Sankranti at 12:30 AM\, 15 Mar IST\n\nChet Sangrand — Bikrami Sambat 2084 New Year / ਚੇਤ ਸੰਗਰਾਂਦ — ਬਿਕ੍ਰਮੀ ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪ ਨਵਾਂ ਸਾਲ\n1 Chet\, Sambat 2084 (Meena Sankranti) · Dawn of Puratan Bikrami Sambat 2084 on 1 Chet\, opening the annual cycle of Barah Maha in Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 133 · Barah Maha Majh Mahalla 5)\n\nShaheedi Divas — Jathedar Akali Baba Phula Singh Ji (Battle of Naushehra) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਜਥੇਦਾਰ ਅਕਾਲੀ ਬਾਬਾ ਫੂਲਾ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਜੰਗ ਨੌਸ਼ਹਿਰਾ)\n1 Chet\, Sambat 2084 (1 Chet\, Sambat 1879) · Martyrdom of Jathedar of Sri Akal Takht Sahib and Budha Dal\, Akali Baba Phula Singh Ji Nihung\, leading the victorious Khalsa charge at the Battle of Naushehra (1823 CE).\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Panth Prakash (Giani Gian Singh) (Entry: Phula Singh Akali · Battle of Naushehra\, 1 Chet 1879)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,Sangrand\,KHALSA\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
