SUMMARY:9 Chet 2084 · Chet Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੯ ਚੇਤ ੨੦੮੪) — Holla Mohalla
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 9 Chet\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੯ ਚੇਤ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Chet Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਚੇਤ ਵਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 02:30 PM\, 23 Mar\n\nHolla Mohalla (Sri Anandpur Sahib) / ਹੋਲਾ ਮਹੱਲਾ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਨੰਦਪੁਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\nChet Vadhi 1 (9 Chet\, Sambat 2084) · Martial Khalsa gathering established by Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji at Qila Holgarh\, Sri Anandpur Sahib in Sambat 1757.\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Rut 4\, Ansu 20–24 · Holgarh Khalsa Martial Gathering) | Bhai Nand Lal Ji — Diwan-e-Goya (Holi-nama · Khalsa Spiritual Chivalry)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
