SUMMARY:27 Chet 2084 · Chet Sudhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) (੨੭ ਚੇਤ ੨੦੮੪) — Parkash Guru Arjan Dev Ji · Baba Jujhar Singh Ji Janam
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 27 Chet\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੨੭ ਚੇਤ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Chet Sudhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) · ਚੇਤ ਸੁਦੀ ੪ (ਚੌਥ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 11:41 PM\, 10 Apr\n\nParkash Purab — Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji (27 Chet · Guru Ram Das Ji Parivar) / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਅਰਜਨ ਦੇਵ ਜੀ (੨੭ ਚੇਤ · ਗੁਰੂ ਰਾਮਦਾਸ ਜੀ ਪਰਿਵਾਰ)\n27 Chet\, Sambat 2084 (Vaisakh Vadhi 7\, Sambat 1620) · Parkash Purab of Fifth Patshah Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji at Goindwal Sahib\, youngest of Sri Guru Ram Das Ji and Bibi Bhani Ji’s three sons (alongside elder brothers Baba Prithi Chand and Baba Mahadev).\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth & Mahan Kosh (Raas 2 · Birth of Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji (Vaisakh Vadhi 7\, 1620))\n\nParkash Purab — Sahibzada Baba Jujhar Singh Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸਾਹਿਬਜ਼ਾਦਾ ਬਾਬਾ ਜੁਝਾਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\n27 Chet\, Sambat 2084 (Chet / Vaisakh Sambat 1748) · Birth anniversary of second Sahibzada Baba Jujhar Singh Ji at Sri Anandpur Sahib (Sambat 1748 Bikrami)\, who fought beside Baba Ajit Singh Ji at Sri Chamkaur Sahib.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Talauda & Guru Kian Sakhian (Sambat 1748 · Sri Anandpur Sahib Birth Record)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,GURPURAB
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
