SUMMARY:3 Vaisakh 2084 · Chet Sudhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) (੩ ਵੈਸਾਖ ੨੦੮੪) — Baba Gurditta Ji & Guru Ghar
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 3 Vaisakh\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੩ ਵੈਸਾਖ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Chet Sudhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) · ਚੇਤ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੦ (ਦਸਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 11:23 AM\, 16 Apr\n\nJoti Jot — Baba Gurditta Ji & Sri Guru Hargobind Sahib Ji Parivar / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ — ਬਾਬਾ ਗੁਰਦਿੱਤਾ ਜੀ ਅਤੇ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਹਰਿਗੋਬਿੰਦ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੀ ਪਰਿਵਾਰ\nChet Sudhi 10 (3 Vaisakh\, Sambat 2084 · Kiratpur Sahib) · Commemorating Baba Gurditta Ji (founder of Kiratpur Sahib & father of Sri Guru Har Rai Sahib Ji) alongside siblings Bibi Viro Ji\, Baba Ani Rai Ji\, Baba Suraj Mal Ji\, Baba Atal Rai Ji\, and Sri Guru Tegh Bahadur Sahib Ji.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi & Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Raas 8 · Baba Gurditta Ji Joti Jot (Chet Sudhi 10\, Sambat 1695))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
