SUMMARY:7 Vaisakh 2084 · Chet Puranmashi (੭ ਵੈਸਾਖ ੨੦੮੪) — Bhagat Pipa Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 7 Vaisakh\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੭ ਵੈਸਾਖ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Chet Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਚੇਤ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:58 AM\, 21 Apr\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Pipa Ji (SGGS Ang 695) / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਪੀਪਾ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅੰਗ ੬੯੫)\nChet Puranmashi (7 Vaisakh\, Sambat 2084 · Traditional) · Traditional Chet Puranmashi commemoration of Bhagat Pipa Ji (former ruler of Gagaraungarh who renounced royalty for Naam Simran)\, author of the profound Raag Dhanasri Shabad on SGGS Ang 695.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 695 · Raag Dhanasri\, Bhagat Pipa Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
