SUMMARY:8 Vaisakh 2084 · Vaisakh Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੮ ਵੈਸਾਖ ੨੦੮੪) — Bhagat Dhanna Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 8 Vaisakh\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੮ ਵੈਸਾਖ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Vaisakh Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਵੈਸਾਖ ਵਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:32 AM\, 22 Apr\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Dhanna Ji (SGGS Ang 487–488\, 695) / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਧੰਨਾ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅੰਗ ੪੮੭–੪੮੮\, ੬੯੫)\n8 Vaisakh\, Sambat 2084 · Parkash Purab of Bhagat Dhanna Ji of Dhuan Kalan (Rajasthan)\, whose three Shabads in Raag Asa and Raag Dhanasri appear in Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 487–488\, 695).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 487–488 & 695 · Raag Asa & Dhanasri\, Bhagat Dhanna Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
