SUMMARY:11 Vaisakh 2084 · Vaisakh Vadhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) (੧੧ ਵੈਸਾਖ ੨੦੮੪) — Bhagat Jaidev Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 11 Vaisakh\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੧੧ ਵੈਸਾਖ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Vaisakh Vadhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) · ਵੈਸਾਖ ਵਦੀ ੪ (ਚੌਥ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 05:44 AM\, 25 Apr\n\nRemembrance — Bhagat Jaidev Ji (SGGS Ang 526\, 1106 · Mahan Kosh Note) / ਯਾਦਗਾਰ — ਭਗਤ ਜੈਦੇਵ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅੰਗ ੫੨੬\, ੧੧੦੬ · ਮਹਾਨ ਕੋਸ਼ ਨੋਟ)\nVaisakh Commemoration (11 Vaisakh 2084 · Exact date unrecorded) · Honoring Bhagat Jaidev Ji (12th-century saint-poet of Kindubilva\, Bengal)\, whose two Shabads in Raag Gujri (Ang 526) and Raag Maru (Ang 1106) are enshrined in Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 526 & 1106 · Raag Gujri & Maru\, Bhagat Jaidev Ji) | Mahan Kosh (Bhai Kahn Singh Nabha) (Entry: Jaidev (ਜੈਦੇਵ) · Historical Chronology Note)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
