SUMMARY:12 Vaisakh 2084 · Vaisakh Vadhi 5 (Panchmi) (੧੨ ਵੈਸਾਖ ੨੦੮੪) — Parkash Guru Tegh Bahadur Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 12 Vaisakh\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੧੨ ਵੈਸਾਖ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Vaisakh Vadhi 5 (Panchmi) · ਵੈਸਾਖ ਵਦੀ ੫ (ਪੰਚਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 07:39 AM\, 26 Apr\n\nParkash Purab — Sri Guru Tegh Bahadur Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਤੇਗ਼ ਬਹਾਦਰ ਜੀ\nVaisakh Vadhi 5 (12 Vaisakh\, Sambat 2084) · Parkash Purab of the Ninth Patshah at Guru Ke Mahal\, Sri Amritsar Sahib (Vaisakh Vadhi 5\, 1678 Bikrami).\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Purbi Dakhani (Vaisakh Vadhi 5\, Sambat 1678 · Birth Record at Chak Ramdaspur (Amritsar))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
