SUMMARY:17 Vaisakh 2084 · Vaisakh Vadhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) (੧੭ ਵੈਸਾਖ ੨੦੮੪) — Sardar Hari Singh Nalwa
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 17 Vaisakh\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੧੭ ਵੈਸਾਖ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Vaisakh Vadhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) · ਵੈਸਾਖ ਵਦੀ ੯ (ਨੌਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 05:16 PM\, 30 Apr\n\nShaheedi Divas — General Sardar Hari Singh Nalwa (Battle of Jamrud) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਜਰਨੈਲ ਸਰਦਾਰ ਹਰੀ ਸਿੰਘ ਨਲੂਆ (ਜੰਗ ਜਮਰੌਦ)\n17 Vaisakh\, Sambat 2084 (30 April 1837 / Sambat 1894) · Martyrdom of Commander-in-Chief of the Khalsa Fauj\, Sardar Hari Singh Nalwa\, defending Fort Jamrud at the mouth of the Khyber Pass (Sambat 1894).\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Khalsa Darbar Records (Entry: Hari Singh Nalwa · Battle of Jamrud (Vaisakh Sambat 1894))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
