SUMMARY:5 Jeth 2084 · Vaisakh Sudhi 14 (Chaudas (Chaturdashi)) (੫ ਜੇਠ ੨੦੮੪) — Parkash Guru Amar Das Ji · Guru Amar Das Ji Parivar
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 5 Jeth\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੫ ਜੇਠ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Vaisakh Sudhi 14 (Chaudas (Chaturdashi)) · ਵੈਸਾਖ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੪ (ਚੌਦਸ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 04:05 PM\, 19 May\n\nParkash Purab — Sri Guru Amar Das Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਅਮਰਦਾਸ ਜੀ\nVaisakh Sudhi 14 (5 Jeth\, Sambat 2084) · Parkash Purab of Third Patshah Sri Guru Amar Das Ji\, founder of Sri Goindwal Sahib\, Manji system\, and author of Anand Sahib.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 917 · Raag Ramkali Mahalla 3 Anand Sahib) | Mehma Prakash (Sarup Das Bhalla) (Sakhi Sri Guru Amar Das Ji · Vaisakh Sudhi 14 Colophon)\n\nGuru Ghar Heritage — Mata Mansa Devi Ji\, Baba Mohan Ji\, Baba Mohri Ji & Bibi Dani Ji / ਗੁਰੂ ਘਰ ਵਿਰਾਸਤ — ਮਾਤਾ ਮਨਸਾ ਦੇਵੀ ਜੀ\, ਬਾਬਾ ਮੋਹਨ ਜੀ\, ਬਾਬਾ ਮੋਹਰੀ ਜੀ ਅਤੇ ਬੀਬੀ ਦਾਨੀ ਜੀ\n5 Jeth\, Sambat 2084 (On Guru Amar Das Ji Parkash) · Honoring the Goindwal Sahib Guru Ghar family of Third Patshah Sri Guru Amar Das Ji: Mata Mansa Devi Ji\, Baba Mohan Ji (custodian of the Goindwal Pothis)\, Baba Mohri Ji\, Bibi Dani Ji\, and Bibi Bhani Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji & Mahan Kosh (Ang 923 · Ramkali Sadd (Baba Mohri Ji & Goindwal Parivar))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,GURPURAB\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
