SUMMARY:25 Jeth 2084 · Jeth Sudhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) (੨੫ ਜੇਠ ੨੦੮੪) — Shaheedi Guru Arjan Dev Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 25 Jeth\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੨੫ ਜੇਠ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Jeth Sudhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) · ਜੇਠ ਸੁਦੀ ੪ (ਚੌਥ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:23 PM\, 8 Jun\n\nShaheedi Divas — Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji (Shaheedan De Sartaj) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਅਰਜਨ ਦੇਵ ਜੀ (ਸ਼ਹੀਦਾਂ ਦੇ ਸਰਤਾਜ)\nJeth Sudhi 4 (25 Jeth\, Sambat 2084) · Martyrdom of the Fifth Patshah at Lahore on Jeth Sudhi 4\, Sambat 1663 Bikrami — serene acceptance of Hukam ("Tera Kiya Meetha Laage").\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 394 · Raag Aasa Mahalla 5) | Tuzuk-e-Jahangiri & Bhai Gurdas Vaar 24 (Vaar 24\, Pauri 23 · Gur Arjan Viton Kurbani)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
