SUMMARY:5 Harh 2084 · Jeth Puranmashi (੫ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ੨੦੮੪) — Bhagat Kabir Ji Parkash
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 5 Harh\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੫ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Jeth Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਜੇਠ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 06:16 AM\, 19 Jun\n\nParkash Purab — Shiromani Bhagat Kabir Ji (SGGS Ang 92–1377) / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ਼੍ਰੋਮਣੀ ਭਗਤ ਕਬੀਰ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅੰਗ ੯੨–੧੩੭੭)\nJeth Puranmashi (5 Harh\, Sambat 2084 · 15 Harh solar note) · Parkash Purab of Bhagat Kabir Ji of Kashi (Banaras)\, whose 226 Shabads and 243 Saloks (SGGS Ang 1364–1377 & across 17 Raags) form the largest Bhagat Bani corpus in Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1349 & 1364–1377 · Raag Prabhati & Salok Bhagat Kabir Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,Puranmashi\,GURPURAB
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
