SUMMARY:15 Harh 2084 · Harh Vadhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) (੧੫ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ੨੦੮੪) — Maharaja Ranjit Singh Barsi
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 15 Harh\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੧੫ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Harh Vadhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) · ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ਵਦੀ ੧੦ (ਦਸਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 10:06 PM\, 29 Jun\n\nBarsi — Sher-e-Punjab Maharaja Ranjit Singh Ji (Sarkar-e-Khalsa) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸ਼ੇਰ-ਏ-ਪੰਜਾਬ ਮਹਾਰਾਜਾ ਰਣਜੀਤ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਸਰਕਾਰ-ਏ-ਖ਼ਾਲਸਾ)\n15 Harh\, Sambat 2084 (15 Harh\, Sambat 1896) · Annual Barsi of Sher-e-Punjab Maharaja Ranjit Singh Ji (1780–1839)\, founder of the sovereign Khalsa Empire (Sarkar-e-Khalsa) who gold-plated Sri Harmandir Sahib.\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Umdat-ut-Tawarikh (Entry: Ranjit Singh Maharaja · 15 Harh\, Sambat 1896 (Lahore))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,BARSI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:daily-2027-06-30@calendar.tatkhalsa.in
DTSTAMP:20260314T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270630
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270701
SUMMARY:16 Harh 2084 · Harh Vadhi 11 (Ekadashi) (੧੬ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ੨੦੮੪) — 16 Harh · Guru Hargobind & Mata Ganga
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 16 Harh\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੧੬ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Harh Vadhi 11 (Ekadashi) · ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ਵਦੀ ੧੧ (ਇਕਾਦਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 08:33 PM\, 30 Jun\n\nSolar Parkash Date — Sri Guru Hargobind Sahib Ji & Mata Ganga Ji Heritage (16 Harh) / ਸੂਰਜੀ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਮਿਤੀ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਹਰਿਗੋਬਿੰਦ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੀ ਅਤੇ ਮਾਤਾ ਗੰਗਾ ਜੀ ਵਿਰਾਸਤ (੧੬ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ)\n16 Harh\, Sambat 2084 (Solar Date · Lunar Harh Vadhi 6 on 25 Jun) · Puratan solar Parkash date (16 Harh) of Sixth Patshah Sri Guru Hargobind Sahib Ji at Wadali Guru\, honoring Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji and Mata Ganga Ji’s Guru Ghar.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 396 · Raag Asa Mahalla 5 (Birth of Sri Guru Hargobind Sahib Ji))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,GURPURAB
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:daily-2027-07-01@calendar.tatkhalsa.in
DTSTAMP:20260314T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270701
