SUMMARY:25 Harh 2084 · Harh Sudhi 6 (Chhat (Shashthi)) (੨੫ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ੨੦੮੪) — Bhai Mani Singh Ji Shaheedi
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 25 Harh\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੨੫ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Harh Sudhi 6 (Chhat (Shashthi)) · ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ਸੁਦੀ ੬ (ਛਠ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 02:05 PM\, 9 Jul\n\nShaheedi Divas — Shaheed-e-Azam Bhai Mani Singh Ji (Band-Band Katwana) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਸ਼ਹੀਦ-ਏ-ਆਜ਼ਮ ਭਾਈ ਮਨੀ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਬੰਦ-ਬੰਦ ਕਟਵਾਉਣਾ)\n25 Harh\, Sambat 2084 (Nakhas Chowk\, Lahore · Sambat 1791/1794) · Martyrdom of Head Granthi of Sri Harmandir Sahib and scribe of Damdami Bir\, Bhai Mani Singh Ji\, who was dismembered joint by joint (band-band) in Lahore.\nSources: Prachin Panth Prakash (Bhai Rattan Singh Bhangu) (Bhai Mani Singh Ji Shaheedi Prasang · Lahore)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
