SUMMARY:1 Sawan 2084 · Harh Sudhi 14 (Chaudas (Chaturdashi)) (੧ ਸਾਵਣ ੨੦੮੪) — Sawan Sangrand · Bhai Taru Singh Ji Shaheedi
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 1 Sawan\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੧ ਸਾਵਣ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Harh Sudhi 14 (Chaudas (Chaturdashi)) · ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੪ (ਚੌਦਸ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 06:50 PM\, 17 Jul\nSangrand: 1 Sawan (ਸਾਵਣ ਸੰਗਰਾਂਦ) · Sankranti at 11:20 PM\, 16 Jul IST\n\nShaheedi Divas — Shaheed Bhai Taru Singh Ji (Khopri Lahuani) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਸ਼ਹੀਦ ਭਾਈ ਤਾਰੂ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਖੋਪਰੀ ਲੁਹਾਉਣੀ)\n1 Sawan\, Sambat 2084 (1 Sawan\, Sambat 1802) · Supreme martyrdom of 25-year-old Bhai Taru Singh Ji of Poola\, who chose to have his scalp removed rather than cut his sacred Kesh in Zakariya Khan’s court in Lahore.\nSources: Prachin Panth Prakash (Bhai Rattan Singh Bhangu) (Shaheedi Bhai Taru Singh Ji · 1 Sawan\, Sambat 1802)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,Sangrand\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
