SUMMARY:2 Bhadon 2084 · Bhadon Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੨ ਭਾਦੋਂ ੨੦੮੪) — Adi Bir Colophon (1661) · 11 Bhatt Sahibaan (SGGS)
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 2 Bhadon\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੨ ਭਾਦੋਂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਵਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:18 PM\, 18 Aug\n\nAdi Bir Completion Colophon (Kartarpur Bir\, Sambat 1661) / ਆਦਿ ਬੀੜ ਸੰਪੂਰਨਤਾ ਹਵਾਲਾ (ਕਰਤਾਰਪੁਰੀ ਬੀੜ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੧੬੬੧)\nBhadon Vadhi 1 (2 Bhadon\, Sambat 2084) · Manuscript colophon recording the completion of scribing Adi Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji at Ramsar Sahib by Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji and Bhai Gurdas Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji — Kartarpur Bir Tatkara Colophon (Folio 1 · Sambat 1661 Miti Bhadon Vadi Ekam (1604 CE))\n\nAll 11 Bhatt Sahibaan — Bhatt De Swayye (SGGS Ang 1389–1409) / ਸਮੂਹ ੧੧ ਭੱਟ ਸਾਹਿਬਾਨ — ਭੱਟਾਂ ਦੇ ਸਵੱਈਏ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅੰਗ ੧੩੮੯–੧੪੦੯)\n2 Bhadon\, Sambat 2084 (Adi Bir Completion · Bhatt Vahis Note) · Commemorating all 11 Bhatt Sahibaan whose 123 Swayye grace Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1389–1409): Bhatt Kalh\, Jalap\, Kirat\, Bhikha\, Salh\, Bhalh\, Nalh\, Gayand\, Mathura\, Balh\, and Harbans.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1389–1409 · Savaiye Sri Mukhbak & Bhatt De Swayye (11 Bhatts)) | Bhatt Vahis & Mahan Kosh (Entry: Bhatt (ਭੱਟ) · 11 Bani-kars of SGGS Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
