SUMMARY:10 Bhadon 2084 · Bhadon Vadhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) (੧੦ ਭਾਦੋਂ ੨੦੮੪) — Bhai Daya Singh Ji Janam
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 10 Bhadon\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੧੦ ਭਾਦੋਂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Vadhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਵਦੀ ੯ (ਨੌਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 05:41 PM\, 26 Aug\n\nJanam Divas — Bhai Daya Singh Ji (First of the Panj Pyare) / ਜਨਮ ਦਿਵਸ — ਭਾਈ ਦਇਆ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਪਹਿਲੇ ਪੰਜ ਪਿਆਰੇ)\n10 Bhadon\, Sambat 2084 · Birth anniversary of Bhai Daya Singh Ji of Lahore (10 Bhadon\, Sambat 1718)\, first Sikh to rise and offer his head on Vaisakhi 1699 and bearer of the Zafarnama to Aurangzeb.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi & Mahan Kosh (Entry: Daya Singh (Panj Pyare) · 10 Bhadon\, Sambat 1718)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
