SUMMARY:20 Bhadon 2084 · Bhadon Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) (੨੦ ਭਾਦੋਂ ੨੦੮੪) — Bhai Gurdas Ji Joti Jot
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 20 Bhadon\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੨੦ ਭਾਦੋਂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਸੁਦੀ ੫ (ਪੰਚਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 11:19 AM\, 5 Sept\n\nJoti Jot Divas — Bhai Gurdas Ji (Scribe of Adi Bir & Author of 40 Vaaran) / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ ਦਿਵਸ — ਭਾਈ ਗੁਰਦਾਸ ਜੀ (ਆਦਿ ਬੀੜ ਦੇ ਲਿਖਾਰੀ ਅਤੇ ੪੦ ਵਾਰਾਂ ਦੇ ਰਚੇਤਾ)\nBhadon Sudhi 5 (20 Bhadon\, Sambat 2084 · Goindwal Sahib) · Passing of Bhai Gurdas Ji at Goindwal Sahib (Bhadon Sudhi 5\, Sambat 1693) in the presence of Sri Guru Hargobind Sahib Ji\; revered scribe of the Adi Bir whose Vaaran were blessed as the "Key to Gurbani."\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Multani Sindhi & Mahan Kosh (Bhadon Sudhi 5\, Sambat 1693 · Goindwal Sahib) | Bhai Gurdas Ji Vaaran (Vaar 1\, Pauri 27 · Sati Gur Nanak Pragatia)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
