SUMMARY:23 Bhadon 2084 · Bhadon Sudhi 8 (Ashtami) (੨੩ ਭਾਦੋਂ ੨੦੮੪) — Chaupai Sahib Colophon
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 23 Bhadon\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੨੩ ਭਾਦੋਂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Sudhi 8 (Ashtami) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਸੁਦੀ ੮ (ਅਸ਼ਟਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:46 PM\, 8 Sept\n\nSri Dasam Granth Colophon — Benti Chaupai Sahib (Sambat 1753) / ਸ੍ਰੀ ਦਸਮ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਹਵਾਲਾ — ਬੇਨਤੀ ਚੌਪਈ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਸੰਪੂਰਨਤਾ (ਸੰਮਤ ੧੭੫੩)\nBhadon Sudhi 8 · Ashtami (23 Bhadon\, Sambat 2084) · Scriptural colophon in Sri Dasam Granth Sahib Ji dating the completion of Charitropakhyan & Kabiyo Bach Benti Chaupai on the banks of the Sutlej (Bhadon Sudhi Ashtami\, 1753 Bikrami).\nSources: Sri Dasam Granth Sahib Ji (Charitropakhyan / Benti Chaupai) (Ang 1388 · Charitar 405\, Chhand 405 · Sambat 1753 Bhadon Sudhi Ashtami)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
