DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 23 Assu\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੨੩ ਅੱਸੂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Assu Sudhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) · ਅੱਸੂ ਸੁਦੀ ੯ (ਨੌਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:03 AM\, 9 Oct\n\nBhog Dussehra Mahattam Paath / ਭੋਗ ਦੁਸਹਿਰਾ ਮਹਾਤਮ ਪਾਠ\nAssu Sudhi 9 (23 Assu\, Sambat 2084) · Traditional Puratan Bhog of Sri Dasam Granth Sahib Ji Dussehra Mahattam and Shastar Darshan Maryada at Takhat Sachkhand Sri Hazur Sahib and Nihang Singh Dals.\nSources: Sri Dasam Granth Sahib Ji (Chandi Di Vaar) (Pauri 1 · Pritham Bhagauti Simar Kai) | Sri Gurpratap Suraj Granth Sahib Ji (Rut 3\, Ansu 26 · Puratan Anandpur & Hazuri Dussehra Shastar Maryada)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
