SUMMARY:26 Assu 2084 · Assu Sudhi 12 (Dwadashi) (੨੬ ਅੱਸੂ ੨੦੮੪) — Janam Baba Budha Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 26 Assu\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੨੬ ਅੱਸੂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Assu Sudhi 12 (Dwadashi) · ਅੱਸੂ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੨ (ਦੁਆਦਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 04:16 PM\, 12 Oct\n\nJanam Divas — Brahmgyani Baba Budha Ji / ਜਨਮ ਦਿਹਾੜਾ — ਬ੍ਰਹਮਗਿਆਨੀ ਬਾਬਾ ਬੁੱਢਾ ਜੀ\nAssu Sudhi 12 (26 Assu\, Sambat 2084) · Birth commemoration of Baba Budha Ji (1563 Bikrami)\, First Head Granthi of Sachkhand Sri Harmandir Sahib who performed Gurgaddi Tilak for five Gurus.\nSources: Sri Gurpratap Suraj Granth Sahib Ji (Raas 4\, Ansu 25 · First Parkash of Adi Granth & Granthi Seva of Baba Budha Ji) | Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 272 · Sukhmani Sahib (Ashtpadi 8 — Attributes of a Brahmgyani))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
