SUMMARY:29 Assu 2084 · Assu Puranmashi (੨੯ ਅੱਸੂ ੨੦੮੪) — Baba Sheikh Farid Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 29 Assu\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੨੯ ਅੱਸੂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Assu Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਅੱਸੂ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 07:18 PM\, 15 Oct\n\nAagman Purab — Baba Sheikh Farid Ji (SGGS Ang 488\, 794\, 1377–1384) / ਆਗਮਨ ਪੁਰਬ — ਬਾਬਾ ਸ਼ੇਖ਼ ਫ਼ਰੀਦ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅੰਗ ੪੮੮\, ੭੯੪\, ੧੩੭੭–੧੩੮੪)\n29 Assu\, Sambat 2084 (Faridkot Annual Commemoration · Mahan Kosh Note) · Commemorating Baba Sheikh Farid Ji (1173–1266 CE\, Pakpattan & Faridkot)\, pioneer of Punjabi spiritual poetry whose 4 Shabads and 112 Saloks grace Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 488\, 794\, 1377–1384).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 488\, 794 & 1377–1384 · Raag Asa\, Suhi & Salok Sheikh Farid Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,Puranmashi\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
