SUMMARY:31 Assu 2084 · Katak Vadhi 2 (Dooj (Dwitiya)) (੩੧ ਅੱਸੂ ੨੦੮੪) — Parkash Guru Ram Das Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 31 Assu\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੩੧ ਅੱਸੂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Vadhi 2 (Dooj (Dwitiya)) · ਕੱਤਕ ਵਦੀ ੨ (ਦੂਜ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 06:45 PM\, 17 Oct\n\nParkash Purab — Sri Guru Ram Das Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਰਾਮਦਾਸ ਜੀ\nKatak Vadhi 2 (31 Assu\, Sambat 2084) · Parkash Purab of Fourth Patshah Sri Guru Ram Das Ji\, founder of Sri Amritsar Sahib (Chuna Mandi\, Lahore\, 1591 Bikrami).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1396–1406 · Swaiye Mahalle Chauthe Ke)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
