SUMMARY:16 Katak 2084 · Katak Sudhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) (੧੬ ਕੱਤਕ ੨੦੮੪) — Gurgaddi SGGS Ji · Barsi Sant Jwala Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 16 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੧੬ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Sudhi 4 (Chauth (Chaturthi)) · ਕੱਤਕ ਸੁਦੀ ੪ (ਚੌਥ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 06:04 PM\, 2 Nov\n\nGurgaddi Divas — Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji / ਗੁਰਗੱਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੀ\nKatak Sudhi 4 (16 Katak\, Sambat 2084) · Bestowal of eternal Guruship upon Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji at Sri Hazur Sahib\, Nanded.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Talauda (Katak Sudhi 4\, Sambat 1765 · Nanded Colophon)\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Jwala Singh Ji (Harkhowal) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਜਵਾਲਾ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਹਰਖੋਵਾਲ)\nKatak Sudhi 4 (16 Katak\, Sambat 2084) · Annual Barsi of Brahmgyani Sant Baba Jwala Singh Ji Harkhowal (1889–1957 CE)\, luminary of Hoti Mardan Samparda.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 273 · Sukhmani Sahib (Ashtpadi 8))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
