SUMMARY:30 Katak 2084 · Maghar Vadhi 3 (Teej (Tritiya)) (੩੦ ਕੱਤਕ ੨੦੮੪) — Shaheedi Baba Deep Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 30 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੩੦ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Vadhi 3 (Teej (Tritiya)) · ਮੱਘਰ ਵਦੀ ੩ (ਤੀਜ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:44 AM\, 17 Nov\n\nShaheedi Divas — Dhan Dhan Baba Deep Singh Ji Shaheed / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਹਾੜਾ — ਧੰਨ ਧੰਨ ਬਾਬਾ ਦੀਪ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ ਸ਼ਹੀਦ\n30 Katak\, Sambat 2084 (Sri Amritsar Sahib\, 1757) · Immortal martyrdom of Baba Deep Singh Ji Shaheed (1814 Bikrami / 1757 CE)\, first Head of Damdami Taksal and Shaheedan Misl\, liberating Sachkhand Sri Harmandir Sahib.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1412 · Salok Vaaran Te Vadhik (Mahalla 1 — Vow of Baba Deep Singh Ji)) | Prachin Panth Prakash (Rattan Singh Bhangu) (Sakhi Baba Deep Singh Ji Shaheed · Battle of Goharwal & Amritsar Parikrama (1814 Bikrami))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
