SUMMARY:13 Maghar 2084 · Maghar Sudhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੧੩ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੪) — Barsi Sant Teja Singh Ji Rara
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 13 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੧੩ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Sudhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਮੱਘਰ ਸੁਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:15 AM\, 29 Nov\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Teja Singh Ji (Rara Sahib) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਤੇਜਾ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਰਾੜਾ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\nMaghar Sudhi 1 (13 Maghar\, Sambat 2084) · Annual Barsi of Sant Baba Teja Singh Ji of Gurdwara Karamsar Rara Sahib\, successor to Sant Baba Isher Singh Ji and Sant Baba Kishan Singh Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 262 · Gauri Sukhmani Mahalla 5)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
