SUMMARY:15 Maghar 2084 · Maghar Sudhi 3 (Teej (Tritiya)) (੧੫ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੪) — Gurgadhi Guru Gobind Singh Ji · Baba Zorawar Singh Ji Janam
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 15 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੧੫ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Sudhi 3 (Teej (Tritiya)) · ਮੱਘਰ ਸੁਦੀ ੩ (ਤੀਜ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 11:41 AM\, 1 Dec\n\nGurgadhi Divas — Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji / ਗੁਰਗੱਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗੋਬਿੰਦ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\nMaghar Sudhi 3 (15 Maghar\, Sambat 2084) · Bestowal of Gurgaddi upon the Tenth Patshah Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji at Chak Nanaki (Sri Anandpur Sahib) following the departure of Sri Guru Tegh Bahadur Ji for Delhi (1732 Bikrami).\nSources: Sri Gurpratap Suraj Granth Sahib Ji (Raas 12\, Ansu 49–55 · Gurgaddi Tilak at Sri Anandpur Sahib (1732 Bikrami)) | Sri Dasam Granth Sahib Ji (Bachitar Natak) (Adhyay 5\, Chhand 16 · Ascension to the Sovereign Guruship)\n\nParkash Purab — Sahibzada Baba Zorawar Singh Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸਾਹਿਬਜ਼ਾਦਾ ਬਾਬਾ ਜ਼ੋਰਾਵਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\n15 Maghar\, Sambat 2084 · Birth anniversary of third Sahibzada Baba Zorawar Singh Ji at Sri Anandpur Sahib (Sambat 1753 Bikrami).\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Talauda & Guru Kian Sakhian (Maghar\, Sambat 1753 · Sri Anandpur Sahib)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,GURPURAB
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:daily-2027-12-02@calendar.tatkhalsa.in
