SUMMARY:19 Maghar 2084 · Maghar Sudhi 7 (Saptami) (੧੯ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੪) — Bhai Mardana Ji Joti Jot
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 19 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੧੯ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Sudhi 7 (Saptami) · ਮੱਘਰ ਸੁਦੀ ੭ (ਸਪਤਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:39 PM\, 5 Dec\n\nJoti Jot Divas — Bhai Mardana Ji (First Rababi & SGGS Bani-kar) / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ ਦਿਵਸ — ਭਾਈ ਮਰਦਾਨਾ ਜੀ (ਪਹਿਲੇ ਰਬਾਬੀ ਅਤੇ ਗੁਰਸਿੱਖ ਬਾਣੀਕਾਰ)\n19 Maghar\, Sambat 2084 (Maghar Vadhi 11 tradition) · Commemoration of Bhai Mardana Ji\, lifelong companion and Rababi of Sri Guru Nanak Dev Ji\, whose three Saloks in Raag Bihagra appear on Ang 553 of Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 553 · Salok Mardana 1 (Raag Bihagra)) | Mahan Kosh (Bhai Kahn Singh Nabha) (Entry: Mardana (ਮਰਦਾਨਾ) · Maghar Sambat 1591)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
