SUMMARY:22 Maghar 2084 · Maghar Sudhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) (੨੨ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੪) — Bhai Sahib Singh Ji Janam
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 22 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੨੨ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Sudhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) · ਮੱਘਰ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੦ (ਦਸਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:01 AM\, 9 Dec\n\nJanam Divas — Bhai Sahib Singh Ji (Panj Pyare) / ਜਨਮ ਦਿਵਸ — ਭਾਈ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਪੰਜ ਪਿਆਰੇ)\n22 Maghar\, Sambat 2084 · Birth anniversary of Bhai Sahib Singh Ji of Bidar (Karnataka)\, fifth of the Panj Pyare blessed at Vaisakhi 1699 and Shaheed at Sri Chamkaur Sahib.\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Bhatt Vahi (Entry: Sahib Singh (Panj Pyare) · Bidar & Chamkaur Sahib)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
