SUMMARY:28 Maghar 2084 · Poh Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੨੮ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੪) — Barsi Baba Thakur Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 28 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੨੮ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਪੋਹ ਵਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 07:04 PM\, 14 Dec\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Thakur Singh Ji (Damdami Taksal) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਠਾਕੁਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਦਮਦਮੀ ਟਕਸਾਲ)\nPoh Vadhi 1 (28 Maghar\, Sambat 2084) · Annual Barsi of Sant Baba Thakur Singh Ji (1915–2004 CE)\, steadfast caretaker Jathedar of Damdami Taksal (Mehta Chowk) and pillar of Panthic Chardi Kala.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 282 · Sukhmani Sahib (Ashtpadi 15))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
