SUMMARY:29 Maghar 2084 · Poh Vadhi 2 (Dooj (Dwitiya)) (੨੯ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੪) — Baba Fateh Singh Ji Janam
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 29 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੨੯ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Vadhi 2 (Dooj (Dwitiya)) · ਪੋਹ ਵਦੀ ੨ (ਦੂਜ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 04:15 PM\, 15 Dec\n\nParkash Purab — Sahibzada Baba Fateh Singh Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸਾਹਿਬਜ਼ਾਦਾ ਬਾਬਾ ਫ਼ਤਹਿ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\n29 Maghar\, Sambat 2084 (11 Phagun alternate tradition noted) · Commemorating the birth of youngest Sahibzada Baba Fateh Singh Ji at Sri Anandpur Sahib (Sambat 1755 Bikrami)\, symbol of fearless Khalsa sovereignty.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Multani Sindhi & Guru Kian Sakhian (Sambat 1755 · Sri Anandpur Sahib Birth Record)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
