DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271222
SUMMARY:6 Poh 2084 · Poh Vadhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) (੬ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੪) — Anandpur Qila Chhodna · Barsi Sant Kishan Singh Ji · Shaheedi Jathedar Kaunke
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 6 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੬ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Vadhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) · ਪੋਹ ਵਦੀ ੯ (ਨੌਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:37 AM\, 22 Dec\n\nShaheedi Hafta — Sri Anandpur Sahib Qila Chhodna (6–7 Poh) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਹਫ਼ਤਾ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਨੰਦਪੁਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਕਿਲ੍ਹਾ ਛੱਡਣਾ (੬–੭ ਪੋਹ)\n6 Poh\, Sambat 2084 (Night of 6–7 Poh\, Sambat 1761) · Opening of Shaheedi Hafta: after an eight-month siege\, Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji\, the Guru Ghar Parivar\, and the Khalsa evacuated Qila Anandgarh on the freezing night of 6–7 Poh\, Sambat 1761.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Talauda & Prachin Panth Prakash (6–7 Poh\, Sambat 1761 · Evacuation of Qila Anandgarh)\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Kishan Singh Ji (Rara Sahib) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਕਿਸ਼ਨ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਰਾੜਾ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\nPoh Vadhi 9 (6 Poh\, Sambat 2084) · Annual Barsi of Sant Baba Kishan Singh Ji\, lifelong companion and sewadar of Sant Baba Isher Singh Ji at Gurdwara Karamsar Rara Sahib.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 286 · Sukhmani Sahib (Ashtpadi 17))\n\nShaheedi Divas — Jathedar Bhai Gurdev Singh Ji Kaunke / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਹਾੜਾ — ਜਥੇਦਾਰ ਭਾਈ ਗੁਰਦੇਵ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ ਕਾਉਂਕੇ\nPoh Vadhi 9 (6 Poh\, Sambat 2084) · Martyrdom commemoration of Acting Jathedar of Sri Akal Takht Sahib Bhai Gurdev Singh Ji Kaunke (1 January 1993).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 579 · Vadahans Mahalla 1 (Alahnia))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI\,BARSI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:daily-2027-12-22@calendar.tatkhalsa.in
DTSTAMP:20260314T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271222
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271223
SUMMARY:7 Poh 2084 · Poh Vadhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) (੭ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੪) — Sarsa Nadi & Bhai Uday/Bachittar Singh
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 7 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੭ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Vadhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) · ਪੋਹ ਵਦੀ ੧੦ (ਦਸਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 11:43 PM\, 22 Dec\n\nShaheedi Hafta — Sarsa Nadi Vichhora\, Bhai Uday Singh Ji & Bhai Bachittar Singh Ji / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਹਫ਼ਤਾ — ਸਰਸਾ ਨਦੀ ਵਿਛੋੜਾ\, ਭਾਈ ਉਦੈ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ ਅਤੇ ਭਾਈ ਬਚਿੱਤਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\n7 Poh\, Sambat 2084 (Parivar Vichhora & Shahi Tibbi) · Separation of Guru Gobind Singh Ji’s family at the flooded Sarsa River (Parivar Vichhora)\, Asa Di Vaar amid battle\, and the legendary martyrdom of Bhai Uday Singh Ji (Shahi Tibbi) and Bhai Bachittar Singh Ji (Malikpur/Kotla Nihang).\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Multani Sindhi & Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Ayan 2\, Ansu 1–12 · Sarsa Nadi\, Shahi Tibbi & Kotla Nihang (7 Poh 1761))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:daily-2027-12-23@calendar.tatkhalsa.in
DTSTAMP:20260314T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271223
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271224
SUMMARY:8 Poh 2084 · Poh Vadhi 11 (Ekadashi) (੮ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੪) — Shaheedi Vadde Sahibzade · Three Panj Pyare (Chamkaur)
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 8 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੮ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Vadhi 11 (Ekadashi) · ਪੋਹ ਵਦੀ ੧੧ (ਇਕਾਦਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 11:14 PM\, 23 Dec\n\nShaheedi Divas — Vadde Sahibzade (Sri Chamkaur Sahib) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਵੱਡੇ ਸਾਹਿਬਜ਼ਾਦੇ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਚਮਕੌਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\n8 Poh\, Sambat 2084 · Annual commemoration of Baba Ajit Singh Ji\, Baba Jujhar Singh Ji\, and the Singhs of Chamkaur Sahib on 8 Poh.\nSources: Prachin Panth Prakash (Rattan Singh Bhangu) (Sakhi Garhi Chamkaur · 8 Poh 1761)\n\nShaheedi Divas — Three Panj Pyare (Bhai Himmat Singh\, Bhai Mohkam Singh & Bhai Sahib Singh Ji) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਤਿੰਨ ਪੰਜ ਪਿਆਰੇ (ਭਾਈ ਹਿੰਮਤ ਸਿੰਘ\, ਭਾਈ ਮੋਹਕਮ ਸਿੰਘ ਅਤੇ ਭਾਈ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ)\n8 Poh\, Sambat 2084 (Battle of Sri Chamkaur Sahib) · Supreme martyrdom of three of the original Panj Pyare—Bhai Himmat Singh Ji (Jagannath Puri)\, Bhai Mohkam Singh Ji (Dwarka)\, and Bhai Sahib Singh Ji (Bidar)—alongside the Vadde Sahibzade and 40 Singhs at Garhi Chamkaur.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Talauda & Prachin Panth Prakash (8 Poh\, Sambat 1761 · Garhi Sri Chamkaur Sahib Martyrs)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
