SUMMARY:20 Poh 2084 · Poh Sudhi 7 (Saptami) (੨੦ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੪) — Parkash Guru Gobind Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 20 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੨੦ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Sudhi 7 (Saptami) · ਪੋਹ ਸੁਦੀ ੭ (ਸਪਤਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 06:21 PM\, 4 Jan\n\nParkash Purab — Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗੋਬਿੰਦ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\nPoh Sudhi 7 (20 Poh\, Sambat 2084) · Parkash Purab of Dashmesh Pita Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji on Poh Sudhi 7 (20 Poh\, Sambat 2084 / Tuesday\, 4 January 2028).\nSources: Sri Dasam Granth Sahib Ji (Bachitar Natak) (Adhyay 7 · Patna Sahib Parkash)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
