SUMMARY:23 Magh 2084 · Magh Sudhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) (੨੩ ਮਾਘ ੨੦੮੪) — Barsi Sant Sundar Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 23 Magh\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੨੩ ਮਾਘ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Magh Sudhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) · ਮਾਘ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੦ (ਦਸਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 11:20 AM\, 6 Feb\n\nBarsi — Sant Giani Sundar Singh Ji Bhindranwale / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਗਿਆਨੀ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ ਭਿੰਡਰਾਂਵਾਲੇ\nMagh Sudhi 10 (23 Magh\, Sambat 2084) · Annual Barsi of Vidya Martand Sant Giani Sundar Singh Ji Bhindranwale (1883–1930 CE)\, Eleventh Head of Damdami Taksal and master teacher of Gurbani Arth & Santhia.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 356 · Asa Mahalla 1)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
