SUMMARY:25 Magh 2084 · Magh Sudhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) (੨੫ ਮਾਘ ੨੦੮੪) — Parkash Guru Har Rai Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 25 Magh\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੨੫ ਮਾਘ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Magh Sudhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) · ਮਾਘ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੩ (ਤੇਰਸ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:48 AM\, 9 Feb\n\nParkash Purab — Sri Guru Har Rai Sahib Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਹਰਿ ਰਾਇ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੀ\nMagh Sudhi 13 (25 Magh\, Sambat 2084) · Parkash Purab of Seventh Patshah Sri Guru Har Rai Sahib Ji on Magh Sudhi 13 (25 Magh\, Sambat 2084).\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Raas 9\, Ansu 1 · Kiratpur Sahib)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
