SUMMARY:9 Phagun 2084 · Phagun Vadhi 12 (Dwadashi) (੯ ਫੱਗਣ ੨੦੮੪) — Saka Sri Nankana Sahib
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 9 Phagun\, Bikrami Sambat 2084 (੯ ਫੱਗਣ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੪)\nLunar Tithi: Phagun Vadhi 12 (Dwadashi) · ਫੱਗਣ ਵਦੀ ੧੨ (ਦੁਆਦਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 08:10 AM\, 22 Feb\n\nShaheedi Saka Sri Nankana Sahib (Bhai Lachhman Singh Ji Dharowali & Shaheed Jatha) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਸਾਕਾ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਨਨਕਾਣਾ ਸਾਹਿਬ (ਭਾਈ ਲਛਮਣ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ ਧਾਰੋਵਾਲੀ ਅਤੇ ਸ਼ਹੀਦ ਜਥਾ)\n9 Phagun\, Sambat 2084 (21 Feb 1921) · Supreme peaceful martyrdom of Bhai Lachhman Singh Ji Dharowali\, Bhai Dalip Singh Ji\, and over 130 Singhs on 20–21 February 1921 liberating Gurdwara Janam Asthan Sri Nankana Sahib.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1412 · Salok Vaaran Te Vadhik (Mahalla 1)) | Saka Nankana Sahib Historical Chronicle (SGPC / Gurdwara Sudhar Lehar) (Phagun 1977 Bikrami (20–21 Feb 1921) · Liberation of Janam Asthan Sri Nankana Sahib)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
