DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280409
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280410
SUMMARY:27 Chet 2085 · Chet Puranmashi (੨੭ ਚੇਤ ੨੦੮੫) — Bhagat Pipa Ji · Baba Jujhar Singh Ji Janam · Parkash Guru Arjan Dev Ji · Bhagat Pipa Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 27 Chet\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੨੭ ਚੇਤ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Chet Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਚੇਤ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:58 PM\, 9 Apr\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Pipa Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਪੀਪਾ ਜੀ\nChet Puranmashi (27 Chet\, Sambat 2085) · Commemoration of Bhagat Pipa Ji on Chet Puranmashi (Ang 695 of Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Raag Dhanasri — Bhagat Pipa Ji) (Ang 695 · Jo Brahmande Soi Pinde)\n\nParkash Purab — Sahibzada Baba Jujhar Singh Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸਾਹਿਬਜ਼ਾਦਾ ਬਾਬਾ ਜੁਝਾਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\n27 Chet\, Sambat 2085 · Birth anniversary of second Sahibzada Baba Jujhar Singh Ji at Sri Anandpur Sahib (Sambat 1748 Bikrami)\, who fought beside Baba Ajit Singh Ji at Sri Chamkaur Sahib.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Talauda & Guru Kian Sakhian (Sambat 1748 · Sri Anandpur Sahib Birth Record)\n\nParkash Purab — Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji (27 Chet · Guru Ram Das Ji Parivar) / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਅਰਜਨ ਦੇਵ ਜੀ (੨੭ ਚੇਤ · ਗੁਰੂ ਰਾਮਦਾਸ ਜੀ ਪਰਿਵਾਰ)\n27 Chet\, Sambat 2085 · Parkash Purab of Fifth Patshah Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji at Goindwal Sahib\, youngest of Sri Guru Ram Das Ji and Bibi Bhani Ji’s three sons (alongside elder brothers Baba Prithi Chand and Baba Mahadev).\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth & Mahan Kosh (Raas 2 · Birth of Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji (Vaisakh Vadhi 7\, 1620))\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Pipa Ji (SGGS Ang 695) / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਪੀਪਾ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅੰਗ ੬੯੫)\nChet Puranmashi (27 Chet\, Sambat 2085) · Traditional Chet Puranmashi commemoration of Bhagat Pipa Ji (former ruler of Gagaraungarh who renounced royalty for Naam Simran)\, author of the profound Raag Dhanasri Shabad on SGGS Ang 695.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 695 · Raag Dhanasri\, Bhagat Pipa Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,Puranmashi\,KHALSA\,GURPURAB
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
