SUMMARY:21 Vaisakh 2085 · Vaisakh Sudhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) (੨੧ ਵੈਸਾਖ ੨੦੮੫) — Mata Bhag Kaur (Mai Bhago)
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 21 Vaisakh\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੨੧ ਵੈਸਾਖ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Vaisakh Sudhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) · ਵੈਸਾਖ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੦ (ਦਸਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 02:14 PM\, 4 May\n\nRemembrance — Mata Bhag Kaur Ji (Mai Bhago Ji · Sri Muktsar Sahib & Hazur Sahib) / ਯਾਦਗਾਰ — ਮਾਤਾ ਭਾਗ ਕੌਰ ਜੀ (ਮਾਈ ਭਾਗੋ ਜੀ · ਸ੍ਰੀ ਮੁਕਤਸਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅਤੇ ਹਜ਼ੂਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\n21 Vaisakh\, Sambat 2085 · Honoring Mata Bhag Kaur Ji (Mai Bhago Ji of Jhabal)\, valiant Khalsa warrior who rallied the Forty Liberated Ones (Chali Mukte) at Khidrana (Sri Muktsar Sahib) and served in Dashmesh Pita’s personal guard to Sri Hazur Sahib.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi & Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Ayan 2 · Mata Bhag Kaur Ji & Battle of Khidrana (21 Vaisakh\, 1762))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
