SUMMARY:22 Sawan 2085 · Bhadon Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੨੨ ਸਾਵਣ ੨੦੮੫) — Adi Bir & 11 Bhatts · Adi Bir Colophon (1661)
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 22 Sawan\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੨੨ ਸਾਵਣ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਵਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:48 PM\, 6 Aug\n\nAdi Bir Completion Colophon (Kartarpur Bir) & All 11 Bhatt Sahibaan / ਆਦਿ ਬੀੜ ਸੰਪੂਰਨਤਾ ਹਵਾਲਾ (ਕਰਤਾਰਪੁਰੀ ਬੀੜ) ਅਤੇ ੧੧ ਭੱਟ ਸਾਹਿਬਾਨ\nBhadon Vadhi 1 (22 Sawan\, Sambat 2085) · Completion anniversary of the Kartarpur Adi Bir (Bhadon Vadhi 1\, 1661 Bikrami) and commemoration of all 11 Bhatt Sahibaan.\nSources: Kartarpur Adi Bir Manuscript Colophon (Sambat 1661 Miti Bhadon Vadi 1 Pothi Likhi Pahunche)\n\nAdi Bir Completion Colophon (Kartarpur Bir\, Sambat 1661) / ਆਦਿ ਬੀੜ ਸੰਪੂਰਨਤਾ ਹਵਾਲਾ (ਕਰਤਾਰਪੁਰੀ ਬੀੜ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੧੬੬੧)\nBhadon Vadhi 1 (22 Sawan\, Sambat 2085) · Manuscript colophon recording the completion of scribing Adi Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji at Ramsar Sahib by Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji and Bhai Gurdas Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji — Kartarpur Bir Tatkara Colophon (Folio 1 · Sambat 1661 Miti Bhadon Vadi Ekam (1604 CE))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:daily-2028-08-07@calendar.tatkhalsa.in
DTSTAMP:20260314T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280807
