SUMMARY:2 Bhadon 2085 · Bhadon Vadhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) (੨ ਭਾਦੋਂ ੨੦੮੫) — 11 Bhatt Sahibaan (SGGS)
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 2 Bhadon\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੨ ਭਾਦੋਂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Vadhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਵਦੀ ੧੩ (ਤੇਰਸ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 11:02 PM\, 18 Aug\n\nAll 11 Bhatt Sahibaan — Bhatt De Swayye (SGGS Ang 1389–1409) / ਸਮੂਹ ੧੧ ਭੱਟ ਸਾਹਿਬਾਨ — ਭੱਟਾਂ ਦੇ ਸਵੱਈਏ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅੰਗ ੧੩੮੯–੧੪੦੯)\n2 Bhadon\, Sambat 2085 · Commemorating all 11 Bhatt Sahibaan whose 123 Swayye grace Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1389–1409): Bhatt Kalh\, Jalap\, Kirat\, Bhikha\, Salh\, Bhalh\, Nalh\, Gayand\, Mathura\, Balh\, and Harbans.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1389–1409 · Savaiye Sri Mukhbak & Bhatt De Swayye (11 Bhatts)) | Bhatt Vahis & Mahan Kosh (Entry: Bhatt (ਭੱਟ) · 11 Bani-kars of SGGS Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
