SUMMARY:5 Bhadon 2085 · Bhadon Sudhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੫ ਭਾਦੋਂ ੨੦੮੫) — Pehla Parkash SGGS Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 5 Bhadon\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੫ ਭਾਦੋਂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Sudhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਸੁਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:31 PM\, 21 Aug\n\nPehla Parkash Purab — Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (422nd Anniversary) / ਪਹਿਲਾ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੀ (੪੨੨ਵਾਂ ਦਿਹਾੜਾ)\nBhadon Sudhi 1 (5 Bhadon\, Sambat 2085) · 422nd anniversary of the First Installation of Adi Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji at Sachkhand Sri Harmandir Sahib on Bhadon Sudhi 1.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (First Hukamnama — Raag Suhi Mahalla 5) (Ang 783 · Santa Ke Karaj Aap Khaloya)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
