DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 8 Bhadon\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੮ ਭਾਦੋਂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਸੁਦੀ ੫ (ਪੰਚਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 11:11 PM\, 24 Aug\n\nJoti Jot — Bhai Gurdas Ji / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ — ਭਾਈ ਗੁਰਦਾਸ ਜੀ\nBhadon Sudhi 5 (8 Bhadon\, Sambat 2085) · Annual commemoration of Bhai Gurdas Ji (scribe of Adi Granth Sahib Ji) on Bhadon Sudhi 5.\nSources: Bhai Gurdas Ji Vaaran (Vaar 1\, Pauri 27 · Satgur Nanak Pragatia)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
