SUMMARY:22 Assu 2085 · Katak Vadhi 5 (Panchmi) (੨੨ ਅੱਸੂ ੨੦੮੫) — Saka Sri Panja Sahib
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 22 Assu\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੨੨ ਅੱਸੂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Vadhi 5 (Panchmi) · ਕੱਤਕ ਵਦੀ ੫ (ਪੰਚਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 05:44 AM\, 9 Oct\n\nShaheedi Saka Sri Panja Sahib (Bhai Partap Singh & Bhai Karam Singh Ji) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਸਾਕਾ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪੰਜਾ ਸਾਹਿਬ (ਭਾਈ ਪ੍ਰਤਾਪ ਸਿੰਘ ਤੇ ਭਾਈ ਕਰਮ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ)\nKatak Vadhi 5 (22 Assu\, Sambat 2085) · Martyrdom of Bhai Partap Singh Ji\, Bhai Karam Singh Ji\, and the Sangat who halted a train at Hasan Abdal (1922) to serve Langar to Gurdwara Reform prisoners.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1412 · Salok Vaaran Te Vadhik (Mahalla 1)) | Panthic Historical Record · Gurdwara Sudhar Lehar (14 Katak 1979 Bikrami (30 Oct 1922) · Hasan Abdal Railway Station Saka)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
