DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20281015
SUMMARY:28 Assu 2085 · Katak Vadhi 11 (Ekadashi) (੨੮ ਅੱਸੂ ੨੦੮੫) — Barsi Kavi Santokh Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 28 Assu\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੨੮ ਅੱਸੂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Vadhi 11 (Ekadashi) · ਕੱਤਕ ਵਦੀ ੧੧ (ਇਕਾਦਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 10:30 PM\, 14 Oct\n\nBarsi — Mahakavi Bhai Santokh Singh Ji (Author of Suraj Prakash) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਮਹਾਂਕਵੀ ਭਾਈ ਸੰਤੋਖ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਕਰਤਾ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰਪ੍ਰਤਾਪ ਸੂਰਜ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ)\nKatak Vadhi 11 (28 Assu\, Sambat 2085) · Annual Barsi of Churamani Mahakavi Bhai Santokh Singh Ji (1787–1843 CE)\, immortal author of Sri Nanak Prakash\, Sri Gurpratap Suraj Granth Sahib Ji\, and Garab Ganjani Tika.\nSources: Sri Gurpratap Suraj Granth Sahib Ji (Ayan 2\, Final Ansu (Sambat 1900 Bikrami) · Completion Colophon at Kaithal) | Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 39 · Sri Raag Mahalla 5)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,BARSI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:daily-2028-10-15@calendar.tatkhalsa.in
DTSTAMP:20260314T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20281015
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20281016
SUMMARY:29 Assu 2085 · Katak Vadhi 12 (Dwadashi) (੨੯ ਅੱਸੂ ੨੦੮੫) — Baba Sheikh Farid Ji · Baba Sheikh Farid Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 29 Assu\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੨੯ ਅੱਸੂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Vadhi 12 (Dwadashi) · ਕੱਤਕ ਵਦੀ ੧੨ (ਦੁਆਦਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 07:18 PM\, 15 Oct\n\nAagman Purab — Baba Sheikh Farid Ji / ਆਗਮਨ ਪੁਰਬ — ਬਾਬਾ ਸ਼ੇਖ਼ ਫ਼ਰੀਦ ਜੀ\n29 Assu\, Sambat 2085 · Commemoration of Baba Sheikh Farid Ji (29 Assu\, Sambat 2085)\, whose 112 saloks and 4 shabads grace Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Salok Sheikh Farid Ke) (Ang 1377 · Salok 1)\n\nAagman Purab — Baba Sheikh Farid Ji (SGGS Ang 488\, 794\, 1377–1384) / ਆਗਮਨ ਪੁਰਬ — ਬਾਬਾ ਸ਼ੇਖ਼ ਫ਼ਰੀਦ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅੰਗ ੪੮੮\, ੭੯੪\, ੧੩੭੭–੧੩੮੪)\n29 Assu\, Sambat 2085 · Commemorating Baba Sheikh Farid Ji (1173–1266 CE\, Pakpattan & Faridkot)\, pioneer of Punjabi spiritual poetry whose 4 Shabads and 112 Saloks grace Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 488\, 794\, 1377–1384).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 488\, 794 & 1377–1384 · Raag Asa\, Suhi & Salok Sheikh Farid Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
