SUMMARY:1 Katak 2085 · Katak Vadhi 14 (Chaudas (Chaturdashi)) (੧ ਕੱਤਕ ੨੦੮੫) — Katak Sangrand · Barsi Baba Mitt Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 1 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੧ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Vadhi 14 (Chaudas (Chaturdashi)) · ਕੱਤਕ ਵਦੀ ੧੪ (ਚੌਦਸ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:07 PM\, 17 Oct\nSangrand: 1 Katak (ਕੱਤਕ ਸੰਗਰਾਂਦ) · Sankranti at 08:02 AM\, 17 Oct IST\n\nBarsi — Baba Mitt Singh Ji (Hazuri & Budha Dal Heritage) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਬਾਬਾ ਮਿੱਤ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\nKatak Vadhi 14 (1 Katak\, Sambat 2085) · Annual Barsi commemoration of Baba Mitt Singh Ji\, revered Puratan Nihang Singh and Gurmat Maryada custodian.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 274 · Sukhmani Sahib (Ashtpadi 9))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
