SUMMARY:2 Katak 2085 · Katak Masya (੨ ਕੱਤਕ ੨੦੮੫) — Bandi Chhor Divas
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 2 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੨ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Vadhi 15 (Masya) · ਕੱਤਕ ਵਦੀ ੧੫ (ਮੱਸਿਆ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 08:28 AM\, 18 Oct\n\nBandi Chhor Divas (Sri Guru Hargobind Sahib Ji) / ਬੰਦੀ ਛੋੜ ਦਿਵਸ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਹਰਿਗੋਬਿੰਦ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੀ)\nKatak Masya (2 Katak\, Sambat 2085) · Return of the Sixth Patshah to Sri Amritsar Sahib after securing the freedom of 52 imprisoned rulers from Gwalior Fort.\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Kavi Santokh Singh) (Raas 5\, Ansu 26–32 · Gwalior Fort Liberation & Amritsar Deepmala) | Bhai Gurdas Ji — Vaaran (Vaar 19\, Pauri 6 · Deepmala Metaphor of Gurmat)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
