SUMMARY:6 Katak 2085 · Katak Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) (੬ ਕੱਤਕ ੨੦੮੫) — Joti Jot Guru Gobind Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 6 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੬ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) · ਕੱਤਕ ਸੁਦੀ ੫ (ਪੰਚਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 08:56 PM\, 22 Oct\n\nJoti Jot Divas — Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ ਦਿਵਸ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗੋਬਿੰਦ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\nKatak Sudhi 5 (6 Katak\, Sambat 2085) · Tenth Patshah merged into the Eternal Light at Sachkhand Sri Hazur Sahib\, Nanded on Katak Sudhi 5\, Sambat 1765.\nSources: Sri Gur Sobha (Kavi Sainapati) (Adhyay 18 · Samat 1765 Katak Sudhi Panchmi Colophon) | Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Ayan 2\, Ansu 44 · Sachkhand Payana)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,GURPURAB
