DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 11 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੧੧ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Sudhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) · ਕੱਤਕ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੦ (ਦਸਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:48 AM\, 28 Oct\n\nJanam Divas — Shiromani Bhagat Namdev Ji / ਜਨਮ ਦਿਹਾੜਾ — ਸ਼੍ਰੋਮਣੀ ਭਗਤ ਨਾਮਦੇਵ ਜੀ\nKatak Sudhi 10 (11 Katak\, Sambat 2085) · Birth commemoration of Bhagat Namdev Ji (1270 CE)\, whose 61 luminous hymns are enshrined in Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1164 · Raag Bhairao Bani Bhagat Namdev Ji) | Bhai Gurdas Ji — Vaaran (Vaar 10\, Pauri 1–9 · Devotion of Bhagat Namdev Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
