SUMMARY:17 Katak 2085 · Katak Puranmashi (੧੭ ਕੱਤਕ ੨੦੮੫) — 559th Parkash Sri Guru Nanak Dev Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 17 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੧੭ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਕੱਤਕ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 02:48 PM\, 2 Nov\n\n559th Parkash Purab — Sri Guru Nanak Dev Ji / ੫੫੯ਵਾਂ ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਨਾਨਕ ਦੇਵ ਜੀ\nKatak Puranmashi (17 Katak\, Sambat 2085) · Sacred 559th Parkash Purab of Jagat Guru Sri Guru Nanak Dev Ji\, observed across the Panth on Katak Puranmashi (9 Maghar\, Sambat 2085).\nSources: Bhai Gurdas Ji — Vaaran (Vaar 1\, Pauri 27 · Advent of Satguru Nanak) | Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Nanak Prakash) (Purbaradh\, Adhyay 1 · Katak Puranmashi Tradition at Nankana Sahib) | Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1389 · Swaiye Mahalle Pehle Ke (Bhatt Kal))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
