SUMMARY:27 Katak 2085 · Maghar Vadhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) (੨੭ ਕੱਤਕ ੨੦੮੫) — Barsi Sant Mohan Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 27 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੨੭ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Vadhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) · ਮੱਘਰ ਵਦੀ ੧੦ (ਦਸਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:32 AM\, 12 Nov\n\nBarsi — Sant Giani Mohan Singh Ji Bhindranwale / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਗਿਆਨੀ ਮੋਹਨ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ ਭਿੰਡਰਾਂਵਾਲੇ\nMaghar Vadhi 10 (27 Katak\, Sambat 2085) · Annual Barsi of Sant Giani Mohan Singh Ji Bhindranwale\, renowned Vidvan and Head of Damdami Taksal (Bhindran) who taught hundreds of Gurbani Kathakars.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 595 · Sorath Mahalla 1 (Gurmukh Vidya))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,BARSI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
