SUMMARY:17 Maghar 2085 · Poh Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੧੭ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੫) — Baba Budha Ji Joti Jot · Barsi Baba Thakur Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 17 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੧੭ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਪੋਹ ਵਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 07:13 AM\, 3 Dec\n\nJoti Jot Divas — Brahmgyani Baba Budha Ji (Ramdas) / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ ਦਿਵਸ — ਬ੍ਰਹਮਗਿਆਨੀ ਬਾਬਾ ਬੁੱਢਾ ਜੀ (ਰਮਦਾਸ)\n17 Maghar\, Sambat 2085 · Passing of Brahmgyani Baba Budha Ji at Ramdas (Sambat 1688 Bikrami) in the physical presence of Sixth Patshah Sri Guru Hargobind Sahib Ji.\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Raas 6\, Ansu 42–46 · Baba Budha Ji Joti Jot at Ramdas)\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Thakur Singh Ji (Damdami Taksal) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਠਾਕੁਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਦਮਦਮੀ ਟਕਸਾਲ)\nPoh Vadhi 1 (17 Maghar\, Sambat 2085) · Annual Barsi of Sant Baba Thakur Singh Ji (1915–2004 CE)\, steadfast caretaker Jathedar of Damdami Taksal (Mehta Chowk) and pillar of Panthic Chardi Kala.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 282 · Sukhmani Sahib (Ashtpadi 15))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA\,BARSI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
