SUMMARY:25 Maghar 2085 · Poh Vadhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) (੨੫ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੫) — Mata Sundri Ji · Barsi Sant Kishan Singh Ji · Shaheedi Jathedar Kaunke
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 25 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੨੫ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Vadhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) · ਪੋਹ ਵਦੀ ੯ (ਨੌਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 07:54 PM\, 10 Dec\n\nJoti Jot Remembrance — Mata Sundri Ji (Delhi Panthic Leadership) / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ ਯਾਦਗਾਰ — ਮਾਤਾ ਸੁੰਦਰੀ ਜੀ (ਦਿੱਲੀ ਪੰਥਕ ਅਗਵਾਈ)\n25 Maghar\, Sambat 2085 · Honoring Mata Sundri Ji (Mata of Sahibzada Baba Ajit Singh Ji)\, who guided the Khalsa Panth for nearly four decades from Delhi and commissioned Bhai Mani Singh Ji’s seva at Sri Amritsar Sahib.\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Hukamnamas of Mata Sundri Ji (Entry: Sundri (Mata) · Sambat 1804 Delhi Archive)\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Kishan Singh Ji (Rara Sahib) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਕਿਸ਼ਨ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਰਾੜਾ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\nPoh Vadhi 9 (25 Maghar\, Sambat 2085) · Annual Barsi of Sant Baba Kishan Singh Ji\, lifelong companion and sewadar of Sant Baba Isher Singh Ji at Gurdwara Karamsar Rara Sahib.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 286 · Sukhmani Sahib (Ashtpadi 17))\n\nShaheedi Divas — Jathedar Bhai Gurdev Singh Ji Kaunke / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਹਾੜਾ — ਜਥੇਦਾਰ ਭਾਈ ਗੁਰਦੇਵ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ ਕਾਉਂਕੇ\nPoh Vadhi 9 (25 Maghar\, Sambat 2085) · Martyrdom commemoration of Acting Jathedar of Sri Akal Takht Sahib Bhai Gurdev Singh Ji Kaunke (1 January 1993).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 579 · Vadahans Mahalla 1 (Alahnia))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA\,BARSI\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
