SUMMARY:22 Poh 2085 · Magh Vadhi 6 (Chhat (Shashthi)) (੨੨ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੫) — Janam Baba Deep Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 22 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੨੨ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Magh Vadhi 6 (Chhat (Shashthi)) · ਮਾਘ ਵਦੀ ੬ (ਛਠ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 10:15 AM\, 6 Jan\n\nJanam Divas — Dhan Dhan Baba Deep Singh Ji Shaheed / ਜਨਮ ਦਿਹਾੜਾ — ਧੰਨ ਧੰਨ ਬਾਬਾ ਦੀਪ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ ਸ਼ਹੀਦ\nMagh Vadhi 6 (22 Poh\, Sambat 2085) · Birth commemoration of Baba Deep Singh Ji Shaheed (14 Magh\, 1738 Bikrami / 1682 CE) at Pahuwind (Tarn Taran)\, master scribe of Damdami Bir and warrior-saint of the Khalsa.\nSources: Prachin Panth Prakash & Tawarikh Guru Khalsa (14 Magh 1738 Bikrami · Birth at Pahuwind & Damdama Sahib Scribe Seva) | Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1364 · Salok Kabir Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
