SUMMARY:23 Poh 2085 · Magh Vadhi 7 (Saptami) (੨੩ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੫) — Bhagat Ramanand Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 23 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੨੩ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Magh Vadhi 7 (Saptami) · ਮਾਘ ਵਦੀ ੭ (ਸਪਤਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 08:01 AM\, 7 Jan\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Ramanand Ji (SGGS Ang 1195) / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਰਾਮਾਨੰਦ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅੰਗ ੧੧੯੫)\nMagh Vadhi 7 (23 Poh\, Sambat 2085) · Traditional Magh Vadhi 7 observance of Bhagat Ramanand Ji\, whose sublime Raag Basant Shabad ("Kat jaaeeai re ghar laago rang") graces Ang 1195 of Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1195 · Raag Basant\, Bhagat Ramanand Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
