SUMMARY:15 Magh 2085 · Magh Sudhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) (੧੫ ਮਾਘ ੨੦੮੫) — Parkash Guru Har Rai Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 15 Magh\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੧੫ ਮਾਘ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Magh Sudhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) · ਮਾਘ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੩ (ਤੇਰਸ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:43 PM\, 28 Jan\n\nParkash Purab — Sri Guru Har Rai Sahib Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਹਰਿ ਰਾਇ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੀ\nMagh Sudhi 13 (15 Magh\, Sambat 2085) · Parkash Purab of the Seventh Patshah\, embodiment of compassion\, ecological stewardship\, and Gurbani fidelity (Kiratpur Sahib\, 1686 Bikrami).\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Raas 9\, Ansu 1 · Kiratpur Sahib Parkash & Dawaakhana Tradition)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,GURPURAB
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
