SUMMARY:17 Magh 2085 · Magh Puranmashi (੧੭ ਮਾਘ ੨੦੮੫) — Parkash Bhagat Ravidas Ji · Bhagat Ravidas Ji Parkash
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 17 Magh\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੧੭ ਮਾਘ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Magh Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਮਾਘ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 11:35 AM\, 30 Jan\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Ravidas Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਰਵਿਦਾਸ ਜੀ\nMagh Puranmashi (17 Magh\, Sambat 2085) · Commemoration of Bhagat Ravidas Ji\, whose 41 hymns in Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji envision Begampura\, the city without sorrow.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 345 · Raag Gauri Bani Bhagat Ravidas Ji)\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Ravidas Ji (SGGS 41 Shabads) / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਰਵਿਦਾਸ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ੪੧ ਸ਼ਬਦ)\nMagh Puranmashi (17 Magh\, Sambat 2085) · Parkash Purab of Shiromani Bhagat Ravidas Ji on Magh Puranmashi (28 Magh\, Sambat 2085)\, visionary of Begampura (SGGS Ang 345).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 345 · Raag Gauri\, Bhagat Ravidas Ji (Begampura))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,Puranmashi\,KHALSA\,GURPURAB
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
