SUMMARY:17 Phagun 2085 · Chet Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੧੭ ਫੱਗਣ ੨੦੮੫) — Holla Mohalla · Holla Mohalla
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 17 Phagun\, Bikrami Sambat 2085 (੧੭ ਫੱਗਣ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੫)\nLunar Tithi: Chet Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਚੇਤ ਵਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 07:02 PM\, 1 Mar\n\nHolla Mohalla (Sri Anandpur Sahib) / ਹੋਲਾ ਮਹੱਲਾ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਨੰਦਪੁਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\nChet Vadhi 1 (17 Phagun\, Sambat 2085) · Martial Khalsa gathering established by Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji at Qila Holgarh\, Sri Anandpur Sahib in Sambat 1757.\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Rut 4\, Ansu 20–24 · Holgarh Khalsa Martial Gathering) | Bhai Nand Lal Ji — Diwan-e-Goya (Holi-nama · Khalsa Spiritual Chivalry)\n\nHolla Mohalla (Sri Anandpur Sahib) / ਹੋਲਾ ਮਹੱਲਾ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਨੰਦਪੁਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\nChet Vadhi 1 (17 Phagun\, Sambat 2085) · Khalsa martial gathering at Sri Anandpur Sahib on Chet Vadhi 1 (28 Phagun\, Sambat 2085).\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Rut 4\, Ansu 20–24 · Holgarh Fort)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
