SUMMARY:16 Chet 2086 · Chet Puranmashi (੧੬ ਚੇਤ ੨੦੮੬) — Bhagat Pipa Ji · Holla Mohalla · Bhagat Pipa Ji · Holla Mohalla
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 16 Chet\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੧੬ ਚੇਤ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Chet Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਚੇਤ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 07:58 AM\, 30 Mar\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Pipa Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਪੀਪਾ ਜੀ\nChet Puranmashi (16 Chet\, Sambat 2086) · Commemoration of Bhagat Pipa Ji on Chet Puranmashi (Ang 695 of Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Raag Dhanasri — Bhagat Pipa Ji) (Ang 695 · Jo Brahmande Soi Pinde)\n\nHolla Mohalla (Sri Anandpur Sahib) / ਹੋਲਾ ਮਹੱਲਾ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਨੰਦਪੁਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\nChet Vadhi 1 (16 Chet\, Sambat 2086) · Martial Khalsa gathering established by Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji at Qila Holgarh\, Sri Anandpur Sahib in Sambat 1757.\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Rut 4\, Ansu 20–24 · Holgarh Khalsa Martial Gathering) | Bhai Nand Lal Ji — Diwan-e-Goya (Holi-nama · Khalsa Spiritual Chivalry)\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Pipa Ji (SGGS Ang 695) / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਪੀਪਾ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅੰਗ ੬੯੫)\nChet Puranmashi (16 Chet\, Sambat 2086) · Traditional Chet Puranmashi commemoration of Bhagat Pipa Ji (former ruler of Gagaraungarh who renounced royalty for Naam Simran)\, author of the profound Raag Dhanasri Shabad on SGGS Ang 695.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 695 · Raag Dhanasri\, Bhagat Pipa Ji)\n\nHolla Mohalla (Sri Anandpur Sahib) / ਹੋਲਾ ਮਹੱਲਾ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਨੰਦਪੁਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\nChet Vadhi 1 (16 Chet\, Sambat 2086) · Khalsa martial gathering at Sri Anandpur Sahib on Chet Vadhi 1 (28 Phagun\, Sambat 2086).\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Rut 4\, Ansu 20–24 · Holgarh Fort)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,Puranmashi\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
