SUMMARY:8 Vaisakh 2086 · Chet Sudhi 7 (Saptami) (੮ ਵੈਸਾਖ ੨੦੮੬) — Bhagat Dhanna Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 8 Vaisakh\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੮ ਵੈਸਾਖ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Chet Sudhi 7 (Saptami) · ਚੇਤ ਸੁਦੀ ੭ (ਸਪਤਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 01:36 PM\, 21 Apr\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Dhanna Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਧੰਨਾ ਜੀ\n8 Vaisakh\, Sambat 2086 · Birth commemoration of Shiromani Bhagat Dhanna Ji (8 Vaisakh\, Sambat 2086).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Raag Dhanasri — Bhagat Dhanna Ji) (Ang 695 · Gopal Tera Aarta)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
