SUMMARY:19 Vaisakh 2086 · Vaisakh Vadhi 5 (Panchmi) (੧੯ ਵੈਸਾਖ ੨੦੮੬) — Parkash Guru Tegh Bahadur Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 19 Vaisakh\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੧੯ ਵੈਸਾਖ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Vaisakh Vadhi 5 (Panchmi) · ਵੈਸਾਖ ਵਦੀ ੫ (ਪੰਚਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:05 AM\, 3 May\n\nParkash Purab — Sri Guru Tegh Bahadur Sahib Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਤੇਗ਼ ਬਹਾਦਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੀ\nVaisakh Vadhi 5 (19 Vaisakh\, Sambat 2086) · Parkash Purab of Ninth Patshah Sri Guru Tegh Bahadur Sahib Ji — a rare Sambat 2086 alignment where lunar Vaisakh Vadhi 5 and solar 25 Chet coincide.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Talauda (Pargana Jind) (Vaisakh Vadhi 5\, Sambat 1678 Bikrami · Guru Ke Mahal\, Amritsar)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,GURPURAB
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
