SUMMARY:12 Jeth 2086 · Vaisakh Sudhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) (੧੨ ਜੇਠ ੨੦੮੬) — Parkash Guru Amar Das Ji · Parkash Guru Amar Das Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 12 Jeth\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੧੨ ਜੇਠ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Vaisakh Sudhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) · ਵੈਸਾਖ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੩ (ਤੇਰਸ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 06:37 AM\, 26 May\n\nParkash Purab — Sri Guru Amar Das Ji & Shaheedi Sardar Hari Singh Nalwa / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਅਮਰਦਾਸ ਜੀ ਅਤੇ ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਸਰਦਾਰ ਹਰੀ ਸਿੰਘ ਨਲੂਆ\nVaisakh Sudhi 14 (12 Jeth\, Sambat 2086) · Puratan lunar Parkash Purab of Third Patshah Sri Guru Amar Das Ji (Vaisakh Sudhi 14) and Shaheedi remembrance of Sardar Hari Singh Nalwa (17 Vaisakh).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Raag Ramkali — Anand Sahib) (Ang 917 · Anand Bhaia Meri Maye)\n\nParkash Purab — Sri Guru Amar Das Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਅਮਰਦਾਸ ਜੀ\nVaisakh Sudhi 14 (12 Jeth\, Sambat 2086) · Parkash Purab of Third Patshah Sri Guru Amar Das Ji\, founder of Sri Goindwal Sahib\, Manji system\, and author of Anand Sahib.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 917 · Raag Ramkali Mahalla 3 Anand Sahib) | Mehma Prakash (Sarup Das Bhalla) (Sakhi Sri Guru Amar Das Ji · Vaisakh Sudhi 14 Colophon)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,GURPURAB
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
