DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 4 Harh\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੪ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Jeth Sudhi 6 (Chhat (Shashthi)) · ਜੇਠ ਸੁਦੀ ੬ (ਛਠ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 06:21 AM\, 18 Jun\n\nShaheedi Divas — Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji (Shuddh Jeth Sudhi 4) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਅਰਜਨ ਦੇਵ ਜੀ (ਸ਼ੁੱਧ ਜੇਠ ਸੁਦੀ ੪)\n4 Harh\, Sambat 2086 · Puratan Shaheedi Divas of Fifth Patshah Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji observed on Shuddh Jeth Sudhi 4 (18 June 2026) in the Adhik Jeth intercalary year Sambat 2086.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Raag Asa — Mahalla 5) (Ang 394 · Tera Kiya Meetha Lage) | Bhatt Vahi Multani Sindhi (Jeth Sudhi 4\, Sambat 1663 Bikrami · Lahore Shaheedi)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
