SUMMARY:11 Harh 2086 · Jeth Sudhi 14 (Chaudas (Chaturdashi)) (੧੧ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ੨੦੮੬) — Baba Banda Singh Bahadur
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 11 Harh\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੧੧ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Jeth Sudhi 14 (Chaudas (Chaturdashi)) · ਜੇਠ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੪ (ਚੌਦਸ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 10:57 AM\, 25 Jun\n\nShaheedi Divas — Baba Banda Singh Bahadur & 740 Khalsa Shaheeds / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਬਾਬਾ ਬੰਦਾ ਸਿੰਘ ਬਹਾਦਰ ਅਤੇ ੭੪੦ ਖ਼ਾਲਸਾ ਸ਼ਹੀਦ\n11 Harh\, Sambat 2086 · Martyrdom of Baba Banda Singh Bahadur\, Baba Ajai Singh Ji\, and 740 Khalsa Singhs at Delhi.\nSources: Prachin Panth Prakash (Bhai Rattan Singh Bhangu) (Sirhind Fateh & Delhi Shaheedi Chronicle · 1773 Bikrami)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:daily-2029-06-26@calendar.tatkhalsa.in
DTSTAMP:20260314T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20290626
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20290627
SUMMARY:12 Harh 2086 · Jeth Puranmashi (੧੨ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ੨੦੮੬) — Bhagat Kabir Ji Parkash
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 12 Harh\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੧੨ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Jeth Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਜੇਠ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 08:55 AM\, 26 Jun\n\nParkash Purab — Shiromani Bhagat Kabir Ji (SGGS Ang 92–1377) / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ਼੍ਰੋਮਣੀ ਭਗਤ ਕਬੀਰ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅੰਗ ੯੨–੧੩੭੭)\nJeth Puranmashi (12 Harh\, Sambat 2086) · Parkash Purab of Bhagat Kabir Ji of Kashi (Banaras)\, whose 226 Shabads and 243 Saloks (SGGS Ang 1364–1377 & across 17 Raags) form the largest Bhagat Bani corpus in Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1349 & 1364–1377 · Raag Prabhati & Salok Bhagat Kabir Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,Puranmashi\,GURPURAB
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
