SUMMARY:15 Harh 2086 · Harh Vadhi 3 (Teej (Tritiya)) (੧੫ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ੨੦੮੬) — Bhagat Kabir Ji · Ranjit Singh · Maharaja Ranjit Singh Barsi
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 15 Harh\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੧੫ ਹਾੜ੍ਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Harh Vadhi 3 (Teej (Tritiya)) · ਹਾੜ੍ਹ ਵਦੀ ੩ (ਤੀਜ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 05:49 AM\, 29 Jun\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Kabir Ji & Barsi Maharaja Ranjit Singh Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਕਬੀਰ ਜੀ ਅਤੇ ਬਰਸੀ ਮਹਾਰਾਜਾ ਰਣਜੀਤ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\n15 Harh\, Sambat 2086 · Parkash Purab of Shiromani Bhagat Kabir Ji (Shuddh Jeth Puranmashi) and annual Barsi of Maharaja Ranjit Singh Ji (15 Harh).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Raag Prabhati — Bhagat Kabir Ji) (Ang 1349 · Awal Allah Noor Upaya)\n\nBarsi — Sher-e-Punjab Maharaja Ranjit Singh Ji (Sarkar-e-Khalsa) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸ਼ੇਰ-ਏ-ਪੰਜਾਬ ਮਹਾਰਾਜਾ ਰਣਜੀਤ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਸਰਕਾਰ-ਏ-ਖ਼ਾਲਸਾ)\n15 Harh\, Sambat 2086 · Annual Barsi of Sher-e-Punjab Maharaja Ranjit Singh Ji (1780–1839)\, founder of the sovereign Khalsa Empire (Sarkar-e-Khalsa) who gold-plated Sri Harmandir Sahib.\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Umdat-ut-Tawarikh (Entry: Ranjit Singh Maharaja · 15 Harh\, Sambat 1896 (Lahore))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA\,BARSI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
