SUMMARY:9 Bhadon 2086 · Bhadon Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੯ ਭਾਦੋਂ ੨੦੮੬) — Adi Bir & 11 Bhatts · Adi Bir Colophon (1661)
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 9 Bhadon\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੯ ਭਾਦੋਂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਵਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 08:22 AM\, 25 Aug\n\nAdi Bir Completion Colophon (Kartarpur Bir) & All 11 Bhatt Sahibaan / ਆਦਿ ਬੀੜ ਸੰਪੂਰਨਤਾ ਹਵਾਲਾ (ਕਰਤਾਰਪੁਰੀ ਬੀੜ) ਅਤੇ ੧੧ ਭੱਟ ਸਾਹਿਬਾਨ\nBhadon Vadhi 1 (9 Bhadon\, Sambat 2086) · Completion anniversary of the Kartarpur Adi Bir (Bhadon Vadhi 1\, 1661 Bikrami) and commemoration of all 11 Bhatt Sahibaan.\nSources: Kartarpur Adi Bir Manuscript Colophon (Sambat 1661 Miti Bhadon Vadi 1 Pothi Likhi Pahunche)\n\nAdi Bir Completion Colophon (Kartarpur Bir\, Sambat 1661) / ਆਦਿ ਬੀੜ ਸੰਪੂਰਨਤਾ ਹਵਾਲਾ (ਕਰਤਾਰਪੁਰੀ ਬੀੜ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੧੬੬੧)\nBhadon Vadhi 1 (9 Bhadon\, Sambat 2086) · Manuscript colophon recording the completion of scribing Adi Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji at Ramsar Sahib by Sri Guru Arjan Dev Ji and Bhai Gurdas Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji — Kartarpur Bir Tatkara Colophon (Folio 1 · Sambat 1661 Miti Bhadon Vadi Ekam (1604 CE))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:daily-2029-08-26@calendar.tatkhalsa.in
DTSTAMP:20260314T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20290826
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20290827
SUMMARY:10 Bhadon 2086 · Bhadon Vadhi 2 (Dooj (Dwitiya)) (੧੦ ਭਾਦੋਂ ੨੦੮੬) — Bhai Daya Singh Ji Janam
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 10 Bhadon\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੧੦ ਭਾਦੋਂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Vadhi 2 (Dooj (Dwitiya)) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਵਦੀ ੨ (ਦੂਜ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:47 AM\, 26 Aug\n\nJanam Divas — Bhai Daya Singh Ji (First of the Panj Pyare) / ਜਨਮ ਦਿਵਸ — ਭਾਈ ਦਇਆ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਪਹਿਲੇ ਪੰਜ ਪਿਆਰੇ)\n10 Bhadon\, Sambat 2086 · Birth anniversary of Bhai Daya Singh Ji of Lahore (10 Bhadon\, Sambat 1718)\, first Sikh to rise and offer his head on Vaisakhi 1699 and bearer of the Zafarnama to Aurangzeb.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi & Mahan Kosh (Entry: Daya Singh (Panj Pyare) · 10 Bhadon\, Sambat 1718)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
