SUMMARY:27 Bhadon 2086 · Bhadon Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) (੨੭ ਭਾਦੋਂ ੨੦੮੬) — 6 Bhagat Sahibaan (SGGS) · Bhai Satta & Balwand Ji · Bhai Gurdas Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 27 Bhadon\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੨੭ ਭਾਦੋਂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਸੁਦੀ ੫ (ਪੰਚਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:07 AM\, 13 Sept\n\nBhagat Bani Commemoration — Bhagat Trilochan\, Beni\, Bhikhan\, Sadhna\, Parmanand & Surdas Ji / ਭਗਤ ਬਾਣੀ ਯਾਦਗਾਰ — ਭਗਤ ਤ੍ਰਿਲੋਚਨ\, ਬੇਣੀ\, ਭੀਖਨ\, ਸਧਨਾ\, ਪਰਮਾਨੰਦ ਅਤੇ ਸੂਰਦਾਸ ਜੀ\n27 Bhadon\, Sambat 2086 · Commemorating the six SGGS Bhagat Sahibaan whose exact birth days are unrecorded in Puratan chronicles: Bhagat Trilochan Ji (Ang 92\, 525\, 695)\, Bhagat Beni Ji (Ang 93\, 489\, 1351)\, Bhagat Bhikhan Ji (Ang 659)\, Bhagat Sadhna Ji (Ang 858)\, Bhagat Parmanand Ji (Ang 1253)\, and Bhagat Surdas Ji (Ang 1253).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 92\, 93\, 489\, 525\, 659\, 695\, 858\, 1253\, 1351 · Bhagat Bani) | Mahan Kosh (Bhai Kahn Singh Nabha) (Entries: Trilochan\, Beni\, Bhikhan\, Sadhna\, Parmanand\, Surdas)\n\nGursikh Bani-kars — Bhai Satta Ji & Bhai Balwand Ji (Ramkali Ki Vaar\, SGGS Ang 966) / ਗੁਰਸਿੱਖ ਬਾਣੀਕਾਰ — ਭਾਈ ਸੱਤਾ ਜੀ ਅਤੇ ਭਾਈ ਬਲਵੰਡ ਜੀ (ਰਾਮਕਲੀ ਕੀ ਵਾਰ\, ਅੰਗ ੯੬੬)\n27 Bhadon\, Sambat 2086 · Honoring court Rababis and SGGS Gursikh Bani-kars Bhai Satta Ji & Bhai Balwand Ji\, authors of Ramkali Ki Vaar (Tikke Di Vaar\, Ang 966–968) praising the Guru Gaddi succession.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 966–968 · Ramkali Ki Vaar (Rai Balwand & Satta Doom))\n\nJoti Jot — Bhai Gurdas Ji / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ — ਭਾਈ ਗੁਰਦਾਸ ਜੀ\nBhadon Sudhi 5 (27 Bhadon\, Sambat 2086) · Annual commemoration of Bhai Gurdas Ji (scribe of Adi Granth Sahib Ji) on Bhadon Sudhi 5.\nSources: Bhai Gurdas Ji Vaaran (Vaar 1\, Pauri 27 · Satgur Nanak Pragatia)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA\,BARSI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
