SUMMARY:30 Bhadon 2086 · Bhadon Sudhi 8 (Ashtami) (੩੦ ਭਾਦੋਂ ੨੦੮੬) — Chaupai Sahib Colophon
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 30 Bhadon\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੩੦ ਭਾਦੋਂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Sudhi 8 (Ashtami) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਸੁਦੀ ੮ (ਅਸ਼ਟਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 06:24 PM\, 15 Sept\n\nSri Dasam Granth Colophon — Completion of Benti Chaupai Sahib (1753 Bikrami) / ਸ੍ਰੀ ਦਸਮ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਹਵਾਲਾ — ਬੇਨਤੀ ਚੌਪਈ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਸੰਪੂਰਨਤਾ (੧੭੫੩ ਬਿਕ੍ਰਮੀ)\nBhadon Sudhi 8 (30 Bhadon\, Sambat 2086) · Scriptural colophon anniversary of Benti Chaupai Sahib on Bhadon Sudhi Ashtami (19 September 2026 / 3 Assu\, Sambat 2086).\nSources: Sri Dasam Granth Sahib Ji (Charitropakhyan 405 · Benti Chaupai) (Ang 1388 · Bhadrav Sudhi Ashtami Ravi Vaara\, Teer Satudrav Granth Sudhaara)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
