SUMMARY:4 Assu 2086 · Bhadon Sudhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) (੪ ਅੱਸੂ ੨੦੮੬) — Baba Sri Chand & Bhai Kanhaiya Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 4 Assu\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੪ ਅੱਸੂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Sudhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੩ (ਤੇਰਸ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 07:00 PM\, 20 Sept\n\nJanam Divas — Baba Sri Chand Ji (4 Assu) & Bhai Kanhaiya Ji Remembrance / ਜਨਮ ਦਿਵਸ — ਬਾਬਾ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਚੰਦ ਜੀ (੪ ਅੱਸੂ) ਅਤੇ ਭਾਈ ਘਨ੍ਹੱਈਆ ਜੀ ਯਾਦਗਾਰ\n4 Assu\, Sambat 2086 · Birth anniversary of Baba Sri Chand Ji (elder Sahibzada of Sri Guru Nanak Dev Ji\, Sambat 1551) alongside Assu remembrance of Bhai Kanhaiya Ji\, emblem of universal compassion at Sri Anandpur Sahib.\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Entries: Baba Sri Chand Ji (4 Assu 1551) & Bhai Kanhaiya Ji (Assu 1775))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
