DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 6 Assu\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੬ ਅੱਸੂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Bhadon Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਭਾਦੋਂ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 10:01 PM\, 22 Sept\n\nGursikh Bani-kar — Baba Sundar Ji (Ramkali Sadd\, SGGS Ang 923) / ਗੁਰਸਿੱਖ ਬਾਣੀਕਾਰ — ਬਾਬਾ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਜੀ (ਰਾਮਕਲੀ ਸਦੁ\, ਅੰਗ ੯੨੩)\nBhadon Puranmashi (6 Assu\, Sambat 2086) · Commemorating Baba Sundar Ji (great-grandson of Sri Guru Amar Das Ji) on Bhadon Puranmashi\, who authored the sacred Bani Ramkali Sadd (Ang 923) chronicling Guru Amar Das Ji’s Joti Jot and Gurgaddi to Guru Ram Das Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 923–924 · Ramkali Sadd (Baba Sundar Ji))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
