SUMMARY:19 Assu 2086 · Assu Vadhi 12 (Dwadashi) (੧੯ ਅੱਸੂ ੨੦੮੬) — Guru Nanak Dev Ji Parivar
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 19 Assu\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੧੯ ਅੱਸੂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Assu Vadhi 12 (Dwadashi) · ਅੱਸੂ ਵਦੀ ੧੨ (ਦੁਆਦਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 10:48 AM\, 5 Oct\n\nGuru Ghar Heritage — Bebe Nanaki Ji\, Mata Sulakhni Ji & Baba Lakhmi Das Ji / ਗੁਰੂ ਘਰ ਵਿਰਾਸਤ — ਬੇਬੇ ਨਾਨਕੀ ਜੀ\, ਮਾਤਾ ਸੁਲੱਖਣੀ ਜੀ ਅਤੇ ਬਾਬਾ ਲਖਮੀ ਦਾਸ ਜੀ\n19 Assu\, Sambat 2086 · Honoring Sri Guru Nanak Dev Ji’s sacred family: elder sister Bebe Nanaki Ji (first to recognize Guru Nanak’s divinity)\, consort Mata Sulakhni Ji (Batala & Kartarpur Sahib)\, and younger Sahibzada Baba Lakhmi Das Ji.\nSources: Puratan Janamsakhi & Mahan Kosh (Entries: Bebe Nanaki Ji\, Mata Sulakhni Ji & Baba Lakhmi Das Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
