DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20291016
SUMMARY:29 Assu 2086 · Assu Sudhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) (੨੯ ਅੱਸੂ ੨੦੮੬) — Baba Sheikh Farid Ji · Bhog Dussehra Mahattam · Baba Sheikh Farid Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 29 Assu\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੨੯ ਅੱਸੂ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Assu Sudhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) · ਅੱਸੂ ਸੁਦੀ ੯ (ਨੌਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 04:40 AM\, 16 Oct\n\nAagman Purab — Baba Sheikh Farid Ji / ਆਗਮਨ ਪੁਰਬ — ਬਾਬਾ ਸ਼ੇਖ਼ ਫ਼ਰੀਦ ਜੀ\n29 Assu\, Sambat 2086 · Commemoration of Baba Sheikh Farid Ji (29 Assu\, Sambat 2086)\, whose 112 saloks and 4 shabads grace Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Salok Sheikh Farid Ke) (Ang 1377 · Salok 1)\n\nBhog Dussehra Mahattam Paath / ਭੋਗ ਦੁਸਹਿਰਾ ਮਹਾਤਮ ਪਾਠ\nAssu Sudhi 9 (29 Assu\, Sambat 2086) · Traditional Puratan Bhog of Sri Dasam Granth Sahib Ji Dussehra Mahattam and Shastar Darshan Maryada at Takhat Sachkhand Sri Hazur Sahib and Nihang Singh Dals.\nSources: Sri Dasam Granth Sahib Ji (Chandi Di Vaar) (Pauri 1 · Pritham Bhagauti Simar Kai) | Sri Gurpratap Suraj Granth Sahib Ji (Rut 3\, Ansu 26 · Puratan Anandpur & Hazuri Dussehra Shastar Maryada)\n\nAagman Purab — Baba Sheikh Farid Ji (SGGS Ang 488\, 794\, 1377–1384) / ਆਗਮਨ ਪੁਰਬ — ਬਾਬਾ ਸ਼ੇਖ਼ ਫ਼ਰੀਦ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅੰਗ ੪੮੮\, ੭੯੪\, ੧੩੭੭–੧੩੮੪)\n29 Assu\, Sambat 2086 · Commemorating Baba Sheikh Farid Ji (1173–1266 CE\, Pakpattan & Faridkot)\, pioneer of Punjabi spiritual poetry whose 4 Shabads and 112 Saloks grace Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 488\, 794\, 1377–1384).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 488\, 794 & 1377–1384 · Raag Asa\, Suhi & Salok Sheikh Farid Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
