DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 3 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੩ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Assu Sudhi 12 (Dwadashi) · ਅੱਸੂ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੨ (ਦੁਆਦਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 08:20 AM\, 19 Oct\n\nJanam Divas — Brahmgyani Baba Budha Ji / ਜਨਮ ਦਿਹਾੜਾ — ਬ੍ਰਹਮਗਿਆਨੀ ਬਾਬਾ ਬੁੱਢਾ ਜੀ\nAssu Sudhi 12 (3 Katak\, Sambat 2086) · Birth commemoration of Baba Budha Ji (1563 Bikrami)\, First Head Granthi of Sachkhand Sri Harmandir Sahib who performed Gurgaddi Tilak for five Gurus.\nSources: Sri Gurpratap Suraj Granth Sahib Ji (Raas 4\, Ansu 25 · First Parkash of Adi Granth & Granthi Seva of Baba Budha Ji) | Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 272 · Sukhmani Sahib (Ashtpadi 8 — Attributes of a Brahmgyani))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
