SUMMARY:12 Katak 2086 · Katak Vadhi 6 (Chhat (Shashthi)) (੧੨ ਕੱਤਕ ੨੦੮੬) — Shaheedi Bhai Beant Singh Ji · Barsi Baba Ajit Singh Ji Patna
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 12 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੧੨ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Vadhi 6 (Chhat (Shashthi)) · ਕੱਤਕ ਵਦੀ ੬ (ਛਠ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 04:15 AM\, 29 Oct\n\nShaheedi Divas — Shaheed Bhai Beant Singh Ji / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਹਾੜਾ — ਸ਼ਹੀਦ ਭਾਈ ਬੇਅੰਤ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\nKatak Vadhi 6 (12 Katak\, Sambat 2086) · Remembrance of Shaheed Bhai Beant Singh Ji (15 Katak\, 1984)\, honored by Sri Akal Takht Sahib following the June 1984 assault on Sri Darbar Sahib.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1105 · Maru Kabir Ji)\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Ajit Singh Ji (Takht Sri Patna Sahib) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਅਜੀਤ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਤਖ਼ਤ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਪਟਨਾ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\nKatak Vadhi 6 (12 Katak\, Sambat 2086) · Annual Barsi remembrance of Sant Baba Ajit Singh Ji\, devoted Kar Seva and Kirtan Mahapurakh associated with Takht Sri Harmandir Ji Patna Sahib.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 286 · Sukhmani Sahib (Ashtpadi 17))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI\,BARSI
