SUMMARY:20 Katak 2086 · Katak Vadhi 14 (Chaudas (Chaturdashi)) (੨੦ ਕੱਤਕ ੨੦੮੬) — Barsi Baba Mitt Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 20 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੨੦ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Vadhi 14 (Chaudas (Chaturdashi)) · ਕੱਤਕ ਵਦੀ ੧੪ (ਚੌਦਸ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 01:47 PM\, 5 Nov\n\nBarsi — Baba Mitt Singh Ji (Hazuri & Budha Dal Heritage) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਬਾਬਾ ਮਿੱਤ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\nKatak Vadhi 14 (20 Katak\, Sambat 2086) · Annual Barsi commemoration of Baba Mitt Singh Ji\, revered Puratan Nihang Singh and Gurmat Maryada custodian.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 274 · Sukhmani Sahib (Ashtpadi 9))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
