SUMMARY:25 Katak 2086 · Katak Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) (੨੫ ਕੱਤਕ ੨੦੮੬) — Joti Jot Guru Gobind Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 25 Katak\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੨੫ ਕੱਤਕ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Katak Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) · ਕੱਤਕ ਸੁਦੀ ੫ (ਪੰਚਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 07:16 PM\, 10 Nov\n\nJoti Jot Divas — Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ ਦਿਵਸ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗੋਬਿੰਦ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\nKatak Sudhi 5 (25 Katak\, Sambat 2086) · Tenth Patshah merged into the Eternal Light at Sachkhand Sri Hazur Sahib\, Nanded on Katak Sudhi 5\, Sambat 1765.\nSources: Sri Gur Sobha (Kavi Sainapati) (Adhyay 18 · Samat 1765 Katak Sudhi Panchmi Colophon) | Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Ayan 2\, Ansu 44 · Sachkhand Payana)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
