DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20291203
SUMMARY:17 Maghar 2086 · Maghar Vadhi 11 (Ekadashi) (੧੭ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੬) — Baba Budha Ji Joti Jot · Janam Dr. Bhai Vir Singh Ji · Bhagat Sain Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 17 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੧੭ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Vadhi 11 (Ekadashi) · ਮੱਘਰ ਵਦੀ ੧੧ (ਇਕਾਦਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:53 AM\, 2 Dec\n\nJoti Jot Divas — Brahmgyani Baba Budha Ji (Ramdas) / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ ਦਿਵਸ — ਬ੍ਰਹਮਗਿਆਨੀ ਬਾਬਾ ਬੁੱਢਾ ਜੀ (ਰਮਦਾਸ)\n17 Maghar\, Sambat 2086 · Passing of Brahmgyani Baba Budha Ji at Ramdas (Sambat 1688 Bikrami) in the physical presence of Sixth Patshah Sri Guru Hargobind Sahib Ji.\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Raas 6\, Ansu 42–46 · Baba Budha Ji Joti Jot at Ramdas)\n\nJanam Divas — Bhai Sahib Dr. Bhai Vir Singh Ji / ਜਨਮ ਦਿਹਾੜਾ — ਭਾਈ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਡਾ. ਭਾਈ ਵੀਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\nMaghar Vadhi 12 (17 Maghar\, Sambat 2086) · Birth commemoration of Bhai Sahib Dr. Bhai Vir Singh Ji (1872–1957 CE)\, scholar-saint\, editor of Sri Gurpratap Suraj Granth Sahib Ji (14 vols)\, and father of modern Punjabi literature.\nSources: Sri Gurpratap Suraj Granth Sahib Ji (Edited by Dr. Bhai Vir Singh Ji) (Jild 1 (Prastavna) · Critical Puratan Bikrami Chronology & Footnotes)\n\nParkash Purab — Bhagat Sain Ji (SGGS Ang 695) / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਭਗਤ ਸੈਣ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗ੍ਰੰਥ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅੰਗ ੬੯੫)\nMaghar Vadhi 12 (17 Maghar\, Sambat 2086) · Traditional Maghar Vadhi 12 commemoration of Bhagat Sain Ji\, whose Shabad in Raag Dhanasri (Ang 695) is enshrined in Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji and praised by Bhai Gurdas Ji in Vaar 10.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 695 · Raag Dhanasri\, Bhagat Sain Ji) | Bhai Gurdas Ji Vaaran (Vaar 10\, Pauri 16 · Bhagat Sain Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA\,BARSI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
