SUMMARY:22 Maghar 2086 · Maghar Sudhi 2 (Dooj (Dwitiya)) (੨੨ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੬) — Bhai Sahib Singh Ji Janam
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 22 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੨੨ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Sudhi 2 (Dooj (Dwitiya)) · ਮੱਘਰ ਸੁਦੀ ੨ (ਦੂਜ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 02:27 PM\, 7 Dec\n\nJanam Divas — Bhai Sahib Singh Ji (Panj Pyare) / ਜਨਮ ਦਿਵਸ — ਭਾਈ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਪੰਜ ਪਿਆਰੇ)\n22 Maghar\, Sambat 2086 · Birth anniversary of Bhai Sahib Singh Ji of Bidar (Karnataka)\, fifth of the Panj Pyare blessed at Vaisakhi 1699 and Shaheed at Sri Chamkaur Sahib.\nSources: Mahan Kosh & Bhatt Vahi (Entry: Sahib Singh (Panj Pyare) · Bidar & Chamkaur Sahib)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
