SUMMARY:23 Maghar 2086 · Maghar Sudhi 3 (Teej (Tritiya)) (੨੩ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੬) — Gurgadhi Guru Gobind Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 23 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੨੩ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Sudhi 3 (Teej (Tritiya)) · ਮੱਘਰ ਸੁਦੀ ੩ (ਤੀਜ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:13 PM\, 8 Dec\n\nGurgadhi Divas — Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji / ਗੁਰਗੱਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਗੋਬਿੰਦ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\nMaghar Sudhi 3 (23 Maghar\, Sambat 2086) · Bestowal of Gurgaddi upon the Tenth Patshah Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji at Chak Nanaki (Sri Anandpur Sahib) following the departure of Sri Guru Tegh Bahadur Ji for Delhi (1732 Bikrami).\nSources: Sri Gurpratap Suraj Granth Sahib Ji (Raas 12\, Ansu 49–55 · Gurgaddi Tilak at Sri Anandpur Sahib (1732 Bikrami)) | Sri Dasam Granth Sahib Ji (Bachitar Natak) (Adhyay 5\, Chhand 16 · Ascension to the Sovereign Guruship)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,GURPURAB
