SUMMARY:29 Maghar 2086 · Maghar Sudhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) (੨੯ ਮੱਘਰ ੨੦੮੬) — Baba Fateh Singh Ji Janam
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 29 Maghar\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੨੯ ਮੱਘਰ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Sudhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) · ਮੱਘਰ ਸੁਦੀ ੯ (ਨੌਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 02:14 PM\, 14 Dec\n\nParkash Purab — Sahibzada Baba Fateh Singh Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸਾਹਿਬਜ਼ਾਦਾ ਬਾਬਾ ਫ਼ਤਹਿ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\n29 Maghar\, Sambat 2086 · Commemorating the birth of youngest Sahibzada Baba Fateh Singh Ji at Sri Anandpur Sahib (Sambat 1755 Bikrami)\, symbol of fearless Khalsa sovereignty.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Multani Sindhi & Guru Kian Sakhian (Sambat 1755 · Sri Anandpur Sahib Birth Record)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
