SUMMARY:3 Poh 2086 · Maghar Sudhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) (੩ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੬) — Janam Baba Atal Sahib Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 3 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੩ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Sudhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) · ਮੱਘਰ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੩ (ਤੇਰਸ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:23 AM\, 19 Dec\n\nJanam Divas — Baba Atal Rai Sahib Ji / ਜਨਮ ਦਿਹਾੜਾ — ਬਾਬਾ ਅਟੱਲ ਰਾਇ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੀ\nMaghar Sudhi 13 (3 Poh\, Sambat 2086) · Birth commemoration of Baba Atal Rai Ji (1676 Bikrami)\, luminous son of Sri Guru Hargobind Sahib Ji and Mata Nanaki Ji\, honored by the nine-story Gurdwara Baba Atal Sahib.\nSources: Sri Gurpratap Suraj Granth Sahib Ji (Raas 6\, Ansu 38–42 · Janam & Spiritual Glory of Baba Atal Rai Ji)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
