SUMMARY:5 Poh 2086 · Maghar Puranmashi (੫ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੬) — Mata Jito Ji Joti Jot
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 5 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੫ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Maghar Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਮੱਘਰ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 04:18 AM\, 21 Dec\n\nJoti Jot Divas — Mata Jito Ji (Sri Anandpur Sahib) / ਜੋਤੀ ਜੋਤ ਦਿਵਸ — ਮਾਤਾ ਜੀਤੋ ਜੀ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਨੰਦਪੁਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\n5 Poh\, Sambat 2086 · Passing of Mata Jito Ji (mother of Sahibzade Baba Jujhar Singh Ji\, Baba Zorawar Singh Ji & Baba Fateh Singh Ji) at Sri Anandpur Sahib (Agampura).\nSources: Bhatt Vahi & Guru Kian Sakhian (5 Poh\, Sambat 1757 · Agampura\, Sri Anandpur Sahib)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,Puranmashi\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
