SUMMARY:6 Poh 2086 · Poh Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) (੬ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੬) — Anandpur Qila Chhodna · Barsi Baba Thakur Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 6 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੬ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Vadhi 1 (Ekam (Pratipada)) · ਪੋਹ ਵਦੀ ੧ (ਏਕਮ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 05:38 AM\, 22 Dec\n\nShaheedi Hafta — Sri Anandpur Sahib Qila Chhodna (6–7 Poh) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਹਫ਼ਤਾ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਨੰਦਪੁਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਕਿਲ੍ਹਾ ਛੱਡਣਾ (੬–੭ ਪੋਹ)\n6 Poh\, Sambat 2086 · Opening of Shaheedi Hafta: after an eight-month siege\, Sri Guru Gobind Singh Ji\, the Guru Ghar Parivar\, and the Khalsa evacuated Qila Anandgarh on the freezing night of 6–7 Poh\, Sambat 1761.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Talauda & Prachin Panth Prakash (6–7 Poh\, Sambat 1761 · Evacuation of Qila Anandgarh)\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Thakur Singh Ji (Damdami Taksal) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਠਾਕੁਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਦਮਦਮੀ ਟਕਸਾਲ)\nPoh Vadhi 1 (6 Poh\, Sambat 2086) · Annual Barsi of Sant Baba Thakur Singh Ji (1915–2004 CE)\, steadfast caretaker Jathedar of Damdami Taksal (Mehta Chowk) and pillar of Panthic Chardi Kala.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 282 · Sukhmani Sahib (Ashtpadi 15))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI\,BARSI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:daily-2029-12-22@calendar.tatkhalsa.in
DTSTAMP:20260314T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20291222
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20291223
SUMMARY:7 Poh 2086 · Poh Vadhi 2 (Dooj (Dwitiya)) (੭ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੬) — Sarsa Nadi & Bhai Uday/Bachittar Singh
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 7 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੭ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Vadhi 2 (Dooj (Dwitiya)) · ਪੋਹ ਵਦੀ ੨ (ਦੂਜ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 06:31 AM\, 23 Dec\n\nShaheedi Hafta — Sarsa Nadi Vichhora\, Bhai Uday Singh Ji & Bhai Bachittar Singh Ji / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਹਫ਼ਤਾ — ਸਰਸਾ ਨਦੀ ਵਿਛੋੜਾ\, ਭਾਈ ਉਦੈ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ ਅਤੇ ਭਾਈ ਬਚਿੱਤਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\n7 Poh\, Sambat 2086 · Separation of Guru Gobind Singh Ji’s family at the flooded Sarsa River (Parivar Vichhora)\, Asa Di Vaar amid battle\, and the legendary martyrdom of Bhai Uday Singh Ji (Shahi Tibbi) and Bhai Bachittar Singh Ji (Malikpur/Kotla Nihang).\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Multani Sindhi & Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Ayan 2\, Ansu 1–12 · Sarsa Nadi\, Shahi Tibbi & Kotla Nihang (7 Poh 1761))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:daily-2029-12-23@calendar.tatkhalsa.in
DTSTAMP:20260314T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20291223
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20291224
SUMMARY:8 Poh 2086 · Poh Vadhi 3 (Teej (Tritiya)) (੮ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੬) — Shaheedi Vadde Sahibzade · Three Panj Pyare (Chamkaur)
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 8 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੮ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Vadhi 3 (Teej (Tritiya)) · ਪੋਹ ਵਦੀ ੩ (ਤੀਜ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 06:57 AM\, 24 Dec\n\nShaheedi Divas — Vadde Sahibzade (Sri Chamkaur Sahib) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਵੱਡੇ ਸਾਹਿਬਜ਼ਾਦੇ (ਸ੍ਰੀ ਚਮਕੌਰ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\n8 Poh\, Sambat 2086 · Martyrdom of Baba Ajit Singh Ji\, Baba Jujhar Singh Ji\, and the Singhs of Garhi Chamkaur (8 Poh\, 1761 Bikrami).\nSources: Sri Dasam Granth Sahib Ji (Zafarnama) (Verses 19–22 & 78 · Battle of Chamkaur & Four Sons) | Prachin Panth Prakash (Rattan Singh Bhangu) (Sakhi Garhi Chamkaur · 8 Poh 1761 Bikrami)\n\nShaheedi Divas — Three Panj Pyare (Bhai Himmat Singh\, Bhai Mohkam Singh & Bhai Sahib Singh Ji) / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਵਸ — ਤਿੰਨ ਪੰਜ ਪਿਆਰੇ (ਭਾਈ ਹਿੰਮਤ ਸਿੰਘ\, ਭਾਈ ਮੋਹਕਮ ਸਿੰਘ ਅਤੇ ਭਾਈ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ)\n8 Poh\, Sambat 2086 · Supreme martyrdom of three of the original Panj Pyare—Bhai Himmat Singh Ji (Jagannath Puri)\, Bhai Mohkam Singh Ji (Dwarka)\, and Bhai Sahib Singh Ji (Bidar)—alongside the Vadde Sahibzade and 40 Singhs at Garhi Chamkaur.\nSources: Bhatt Vahi Talauda & Prachin Panth Prakash (8 Poh\, Sambat 1761 · Garhi Sri Chamkaur Sahib Martyrs)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,SHAHEEDI
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
