SUMMARY:14 Poh 2086 · Poh Vadhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) (੧੪ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੬) — Barsi Sant Kishan Singh Ji · Shaheedi Jathedar Kaunke
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 14 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੧੪ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Vadhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) · ਪੋਹ ਵਦੀ ੯ (ਨੌਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 12:18 AM\, 30 Dec\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Kishan Singh Ji (Rara Sahib) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਕਿਸ਼ਨ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਰਾੜਾ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\nPoh Vadhi 9 (14 Poh\, Sambat 2086) · Annual Barsi of Sant Baba Kishan Singh Ji\, lifelong companion and sewadar of Sant Baba Isher Singh Ji at Gurdwara Karamsar Rara Sahib.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 286 · Sukhmani Sahib (Ashtpadi 17))\n\nShaheedi Divas — Jathedar Bhai Gurdev Singh Ji Kaunke / ਸ਼ਹੀਦੀ ਦਿਹਾੜਾ — ਜਥੇਦਾਰ ਭਾਈ ਗੁਰਦੇਵ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ ਕਾਉਂਕੇ\nPoh Vadhi 9 (14 Poh\, Sambat 2086) · Martyrdom commemoration of Acting Jathedar of Sri Akal Takht Sahib Bhai Gurdev Singh Ji Kaunke (1 January 1993).\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 579 · Vadahans Mahalla 1 (Alahnia))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,BARSI\,SHAHEEDI
