SUMMARY:17 Poh 2086 · Poh Vadhi 12 (Dwadashi) (੧੭ ਪੋਹ ੨੦੮੬) — Barsi Sant Harnam Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 17 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੧੭ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Vadhi 12 (Dwadashi) · ਪੋਹ ਵਦੀ ੧੨ (ਦੁਆਦਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 04:26 PM\, 1 Jan\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Harnam Singh Ji (Rampur Khera Wale) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਹਰਨਾਮ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਰਾਮਪੁਰ ਖੇੜਾ ਵਾਲੇ)\nPoh Vadhi 12 (17 Poh\, Sambat 2086) · Annual Barsi of Sant Baba Harnam Singh Ji Rampur Khera Wale (1897–1983 CE)\, whose spiritual biography "Se Kinehiya" has inspired seekers globally.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1102 · Maru Vaar Mahalla 5 (Dakhne — Inspiration of "Se Kinehiya"))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
