DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 24 Poh\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੨੪ ਪੋਹ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) · ਪੋਹ ਸੁਦੀ ੫ (ਪੰਚਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:32 AM\, 9 Jan\n\nBasant Ruth Arambh (Inauguration of Raag Basant Kirtan) / ਬਸੰਤ ਰੁੱਤ ਆਰੰਭ (ਰਾਗ ਬਸੰਤ ਕੀਰਤਨ ਦੀ ਸ਼ੁਰੂਆਤ)\nPoh Sudhi 5 (24 Poh\, Sambat 2086) · Puratan Gurdwara Maryada marking the commencement of Raag Basant Kirtan (Lohri / Maghi eve) through Holla Mohalla at Sachkhand Sri Harmandir Sahib and all Takhts.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1176 · Raag Basant Mahalla 3 (Basant Ki Vaar & Seasonal Renewal))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
