DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 6 Magh\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੬ ਮਾਘ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Poh Sudhi 15 (Puranmashi) · ਪੋਹ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੫ (ਪੂਰਨਮਾਸ਼ੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 09:25 PM\, 19 Jan\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Attar Singh Ji (Reru Sahib Wale) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਅਤਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਰੇਰੂ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਵਾਲੇ)\nPoh Puranmashi (6 Magh\, Sambat 2086) · Annual Barsi of Brahmgyani Sant Baba Attar Singh Ji Reru Sahib (1867–1927 CE)\, whose spiritual grace transformed Reru Sahib and inspired Sant Baba Isher Singh Ji Rara Sahib.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 272 · Sukhmani Sahib (Ashtpadi 8))\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
