SUMMARY:15 Magh 2086 · Magh Vadhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) (੧੫ ਮਾਘ ੨੦੮੬) — Barsi Sant Attar Singh Ji Mastuana
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 15 Magh\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੧੫ ਮਾਘ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Magh Vadhi 9 (Naumi (Navami)) · ਮਾਘ ਵਦੀ ੯ (ਨੌਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 08:40 AM\, 28 Jan\n\nBarsi — Sant Baba Attar Singh Ji (Mastuana Sahib) / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਬਾਬਾ ਅਤਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ (ਮਸਤੂਆਣਾ ਸਾਹਿਬ)\nMagh Vadhi 10 (15 Magh\, Sambat 2086) · Annual Barsi of Sant Baba Attar Singh Ji Mastuana Sahib (1866–1927 CE)\, towering pioneer of Amrit Prachar\, Gurmat Vidyalayas\, and Nirmala-Panthic revival.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 749 · Suhi Mahalla 5) | Jeevan Charitar Sant Attar Singh Ji (Sant Teja Singh M.A.) (Hazur Sahib Tapasya & Mastuana Sahib Gurmat Vidya Mission)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
