SUMMARY:25 Magh 2086 · Magh Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) (੨੫ ਮਾਘ ੨੦੮੬) — Basant Panchmi · Janam Baba Ajit Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 25 Magh\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੨੫ ਮਾਘ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Magh Sudhi 5 (Panchmi) · ਮਾਘ ਸੁਦੀ ੫ (ਪੰਚਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 11:19 PM\, 7 Feb\n\nBasant Panchmi — Gurdwara Dukhniwaran Sahib & Chheharta Sahib Jor Mela / ਬਸੰਤ ਪੰਚਮੀ — ਗੁਰਦੁਆਰਾ ਦੂਖ ਨਿਵਾਰਨ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਅਤੇ ਛੇਹਰਟਾ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੋੜ ਮੇਲਾ\nMagh Sudhi 5 (25 Magh\, Sambat 2086) · Traditional Sikh observance of Magh Sudhi Panchmi commemorating Sri Guru Tegh Bahadur Ji’s healing grace at Patiala (Dukhniwaran Sahib) and Chheharta Sahib.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 1180 · Raag Basant Mahalla 5) | Sri Gurpratap Suraj Granth Sahib Ji (Raas 11 · Lehal Village (Dukhniwaran Sahib) Magh Sudhi Panchmi Hukam)\n\nParkash Purab — Sahibzada Baba Ajit Singh Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸਾਹਿਬਜ਼ਾਦਾ ਬਾਬਾ ਅਜੀਤ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ\nMagh Sudhi 5 (25 Magh\, Sambat 2086) · Birth commemoration of Eldest Sahibzada Baba Ajit Singh Ji (1743 Bikrami / 1687 CE) at Paonta Sahib\, unconquerable warrior of Garhi Chamkaur.\nSources: Sri Gurpratap Suraj Granth Sahib Ji (Rut 2\, Ansu 29 · Paonta Sahib Parkash of Sahibzada Baba Ajit Singh Ji) | Bhatt Vahi Talaunda (Magh 1743 Bikrami · Birth Record of Eldest Sahibzada)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA\,GURPURAB
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
