SUMMARY:1 Phagun 2086 · Magh Sudhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) (੧ ਫੱਗਣ ੨੦੮੬) — Phagun Sangrand · Barsi Sant Sundar Singh Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 1 Phagun\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੧ ਫੱਗਣ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Magh Sudhi 10 (Dasmi (Dashami)) · ਮਾਘ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੦ (ਦਸਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 11:19 AM\, 13 Feb\nSangrand: 1 Phagun (ਫੱਗਣ ਸੰਗਰਾਂਦ) · Sankranti at 04:25 AM\, 13 Feb IST\n\nBarsi — Sant Giani Sundar Singh Ji Bhindranwale / ਬਰਸੀ — ਸੰਤ ਗਿਆਨੀ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ ਭਿੰਡਰਾਂਵਾਲੇ\nMagh Sudhi 10 (1 Phagun\, Sambat 2086) · Annual Barsi of Vidya Martand Sant Giani Sundar Singh Ji Bhindranwale (1883–1930 CE)\, Eleventh Head of Damdami Taksal and master teacher of Gurbani Arth & Santhia.\nSources: Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji (Ang 356 · Asa Mahalla 1)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
