SUMMARY:4 Phagun 2086 · Magh Sudhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) (੪ ਫੱਗਣ ੨੦੮੬) — Parkash Guru Har Rai Ji
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 4 Phagun\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੪ ਫੱਗਣ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Magh Sudhi 13 (Teras (Trayodashi)) · ਮਾਘ ਸੁਦੀ ੧੩ (ਤੇਰਸ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 01:45 PM\, 16 Feb\n\nParkash Purab — Sri Guru Har Rai Sahib Ji / ਪ੍ਰਕਾਸ਼ ਪੁਰਬ — ਸ੍ਰੀ ਗੁਰੂ ਹਰਿ ਰਾਇ ਸਾਹਿਬ ਜੀ\nMagh Sudhi 13 (4 Phagun\, Sambat 2086) · Parkash Purab of the Seventh Patshah\, embodiment of compassion\, ecological stewardship\, and Gurbani fidelity (Kiratpur Sahib\, 1686 Bikrami).\nSources: Sri Gur Pratap Suraj Granth (Raas 9\, Ansu 1 · Kiratpur Sahib Parkash & Dawaakhana Tradition)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
