DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20300312
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20300313
SUMMARY:28 Phagun 2086 · Phagun Sudhi 8 (Ashtami) (੨੮ ਫੱਗਣ ੨੦੮੬) — Delhi Fateh (1783)
DESCRIPTION:Desi Solar Date: 28 Phagun\, Bikrami Sambat 2086 (੨੮ ਫੱਗਣ\, ਸੰਮਤ ੨੦੮੬)\nLunar Tithi: Phagun Sudhi 8 (Ashtami) · ਫੱਗਣ ਸੁਦੀ ੮ (ਅਸ਼ਟਮੀ)\nTithi ends (Sri Anandpur Sahib IST): 03:24 AM\, 13 Mar\n\nDelhi Fateh Divas — Baba Baghel Singh Ji & Sultan-ul-Qaum Sardar Jassa Singh Ahluwalia / ਦਿੱਲੀ ਫ਼ਤਹਿ ਦਿਵਸ — ਬਾਬਾ ਬਘੇਲ ਸਿੰਘ ਜੀ ਅਤੇ ਸੁਲਤਾਨ-ਉਲ-ਕੌਮ ਸਰਦਾਰ ਜੱਸਾ ਸਿੰਘ ਆਹਲੂਵਾਲੀਆ\n28 Phagun\, Sambat 2086 · Khalsa conquest of the Red Fort in Delhi (Sambat 1839) led by Baba Baghel Singh Ji\, Sardar Jassa Singh Ahluwalia\, and Sardar Jassa Singh Ramgarhia\, establishing historic Delhi Gurdwaras.\nSources: Prachin Panth Prakash (Bhai Rattan Singh Bhangu) (Delhi Fateh & Gurdwara Seva · Phagun Sambat 1839)\n\nhttps://calendar.tatkhalsa.in/
CATEGORIES:Tat Khalsa Puratan Jantri\,Daily Bikrami\,KHALSA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
